<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id" />
  <para style="toc3">Mal</para>
  <para style="toc2">MALAKO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Bwɛndi Bopele bokoma Malako</para>
  <para style="mt2">Bwɛndi bopele bokoma MALAKO</para>
  <para style="mt1">MALAKO</para>
  <para style="imt">Bokwea ta buku</para>
  <para style="ip">Ta mɛndi mapale masusu manɛi, Malako anɔi na bokuwe ko akomamaka pongono boso.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bobanga molɔngɔ moboso ainedjakadea Yesu ondingo «Mwana o Ndjakomba» (1.1). Endelo kombe emina iyena e bokamodja, aelangaka mbala djinɛnɛ ta tei e bwɛndi bosusu (1.11; 9.7; boindja pongono 3.11; 5.7), ebwani bodikama sɛkɛlɛ ta bobwana na posa e Yesu (Boindja 3.12; 5.43; 7. 24; 8.30; 9.30). Tina nda? Modjɔ mo ebwani bosipoama oko okaindja Moto ogwa ta ekulusu ondingo ndenge eɛnɛ mokondji o basodha o Loma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Na tina emina, ndelo eimanadea molomami o mondumba imua etungi na moto omɔti omɔti bomoasɔ bopele. Yoani Mobatisi asɛlingodjaka bato ba Ndjakomba edi mosala mo nde (1, 2-8), iyo Yesu atomba pongono batisimo ta di iyo (1, 9-11).</para>
  <para style="ip">Na boa, ngɔngɔ dji ehole e bomekama ko ebodikama iyo mɛnɛ (1, 12-13), bobanga bo bodjebama bo Yesu. Iboa Malako ainedji seko kpati e Yesu, mbala djinɛnɛ iyana abeayaka iyo bato bamokimane ko iyana alehaka iyo bimumu iyana apaka iyo mohelo adi bato ba bipeko (1, 14–8.30).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ta isolo di nde di bababae, Malako ainedji Yesu akwei ta tei minɔngɔ, yogo ko na bosisoa ta bogwa djimoambaka ta Yelusalɛmɛ (8, 31–10, 52). Mbala djisato, atɔndei mɛko mimina batingami ba nde, endelo baisipoa. Abalakadea seko na bonɔ na nde iyo mɛnɛ na bosainedja ondingo «Mwana o moto», endelo mobombamo modaaka ta tei e bomoto bo nde modikamaka seko monɛnɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ta Yelusalɛmɛ, iyana akwea iyo na kilingo, abengani batɛki ta tepelo asongana mbala emɔti na babanei ba mɛko mi Ndjakomba ba Isalɛlɛ ibi bamolonaka. Edii tina e nde enɔli e eleho e suka tadi baloni ba nde, tadii emumu, tadii batingami ba nde (ekenge enɛnɛ. 11–13).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ta ekenge enɛnɛ e 14 ko na 15 djibalakadea tina e masu mabae ma suka ma Yesu. Iyana otaneadea na bonɔ isolo di mia ma suka ayaka na batingami ba nde (akabana na bu ipa ko na vino), miɔngɔnɔ mi nde iyo mɛnɛ ta bgie e Getesemani, bopeama bo nde, bokwa bo nde na ikambo, bogwa bo nde ta ekulusu, bopuseama bo nde. Puma sɛɛnɛ e sena e yogo e nde, bali batanei ikila di nde bwase ko badjebi asisoi ta bogwa (16, 1-8). Ibo batii na bɔɔ. (Mikanda mikina mibakei midjɔ mikina, mibali na bokue ndambo e bosaenɛmedja bo Yesu bo bosisoa ta bogwa ko na bopimboa bo nde; masolo ma nde madi na mindumba minɛnɛ ta Mɛndi Mapele makina).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ngɔngɔ dji bolanga Bwɛndi Bopele bokoma Malako, odjebadea, ondingo mokondji o basodha ba Loma bo Yesu o Nadjaleta «adaaka mɛnɛ Mwana o Ndjakomba» (15.39).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s1">Bileho bi Yoane Mobatisi</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3, 1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3, 1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yoa 1, 19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Indja mbangi e Bwɛndi Bopele bo Yesu Masiya, Mwana o Ndjakomba. <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Ta buku e motɛli Isaya, ekomama bo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">«Indja, nalomakadea molomami o mbi ta boso bo wɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">bɛngi aobɔngedje ndjea.<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Edii kɔpi e moto omɔti agamakadea ta etengelenge bo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">Bɔngedjani ndjea e Kumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">dongedjani mabaku bɛngi ndjea dji kɛkɛkɛkɛ djiemae bodju!»<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Yoane Mobatisi aimana ta etengelenge. Adumbeaka bo: «Hombedjani milema, batisamani bɛngi odieni ekutubanedji e pekato dji bino.» <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Bato basusu ba Yudha ko bato ba Yelusalɛmɛ bakɛɛ ta dii iyo; ko bahuodjaka pekato dji bobo ko ba batisama ta Yɔlɔdane. <verse eid="MRK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Yoane alwaka esendja e yobo e tito okabee ibo kamela na mosenge mo yobo e tito ta bongo;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 2 Bak 1.8.</char></note> ayakaka katangenge na mosua mo pɔki. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Atɔndeaka bo: «Moto omɔti aduadea ngɔngɔ dji mbi anɔi mbi na ngulu; ko nabwaniti, bosunama tina e bolodja mikpulu mi sapato dji nde. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Mbi, naobatisani na madiba, endelo iyo aobatisadeani na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke.» <verse eid="MRK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Iboa, ta masu mamina, Yesu ahula ta Nadjalɛtɛ e Galileya, ko Yoane amobatisa ta Yɔlɔdane. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Ta ehole eimanaka Yesu ta madiba, aenɛ diko didipoami ko Mwembo Mosɛnɔke botita diko di nde ondingo embenga. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Kɔpi emɔti edonga ta busa bo: «Odii Mwana o mbi o epaeli, nasepi na wɛ bobuke mɛnɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Ndjem 2.7; Isa 42.1.</char></note>.» <verse eid="MRK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Na mbala emɔti, Mwembo Mosɛnɔke motomba Yesu ta edhu. <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Akɔɔ masu tuku inɛi, iho ta edhu, amekama na Satana. Adaaka engbanga na tito ba esika ko babwɛndi bamosaleaka.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abei baoweli ba swi banɛi</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 4:12-22">Mat 4, 12-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luk 4, 14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">5, 1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Ngɔngɔ dji boisa Yoane ta bɔlɔkɔ, Yesu akɛɛ ta Galileya; atɔndeaka Bwɛndi Bopele bo Ndjakomba. <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />Ko abalaka bo: «Ehole eimei, ko Bokumu bo Ndjakomba boimei mbuti, hombedjani milema mi bino ko dhimeani Bwɛndi Bopele.» <verse eid="MRK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Yesu anɔɔkɔ ta mokula mo ibeke di Galileya; aɛnɛ Simona na Andele, mwange Simona, badumbaka modjanga ta ibeke; modjɔ mo ibo badaaka baoweli baswi. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Yesu abala na bu ibo: «Kimananini, naoimedjadeani bahombeli ba bato.» <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Na mbala emɔti bakina midjanga mi bobo, ko baso bakimana Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Anɔɔ iyo moo bohali, aɛnɛ Djake, mwana o Djebede ko Yoane mwana o nango, ibo pongono badaaka ta bwato bo bobo, babɔngedjaka midjanga mi bobo. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Na mbala emɔti, Yesu ababea; iboa Bakina sangwabu Djebede, na basali ta bwato, bamokimana.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Moto oyekeama na mwembo mobe</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luk 4, 31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Baimea ta Kapalanaume. Ta busa bo sabata, Yesu akwea ta ndako e miɔngɔnɔ mi Bayudha, ko alehaka. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Eleho e nde ekamodja bato basusu ba mohokamedjaka; modjɔ mo abalehaka ondingo moto odii na kpati botikoana na balehi ba mobeko. <verse eid="MRK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Oko ta ehole emina ta ndako e miɔngɔnɔ moto omɔti adaaka na mwembo mo pita; agama bo: <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />«Modjɔ mo biso na wɛ nda Yesu o Nadjalɛtɛ? Odoi bɛngi o lowoe? Nadjebakadea bopele mɛnɛ bo: Odii Mosɛnɔke o Ndjakomba!» <verse eid="MRK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Yesu agamea membo mibe ko amipa enɔi: «Dipa monɔkɔ mo wɛ ko imana ta dii iyo.» <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Mwembo mo pita momokumanedja ko mogama na ngulu ko moimana na nde. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Bato basusu, bakamoa ko basawadjaka bo: «Imu modjɔ nda? Indjani eleho e yeene ko na kpati esusu! Apakadea nongo membo mi pita mitindo ko mimosumakadea.» <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Na mbala emɔti gala e nde enangana ta Galileya mobimba.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aheledji bato ba bipeko banɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat 8, 14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luk 4, 38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Yesu aimana ta ndako e miɔngɔnɔ, na Djake ko na Yoane bakɛɛ ta dii Simona ko na Andele. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Bokiyo bo Simona o mwali adaaka asambi na pɛpɛlɛ; na mbala emɔti baso bamotɔndea gala e nde. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Abatama, ko amopea ta ebɔ, amoangɔdjɔ. Pɛpɛlɛ esia ko abanga bobakɔmedja.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Ndelo e mɔkɔmɔkɔ, abosama bo modaakabusa, balwɛkɛ Yesu bato ba bego basusu, na ibia badaaka na membo mibe. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Emumu e bato basusu ba ngando enɛnɛ baputoanaka ta modipe mo ndako. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Yesu aheledja bato ba bego mindumba mi misusu, ko abengana pongono membo mibe minɛnɛ, ko aipalaka membo mibale modjɔ mo midjebaka eka edii iyo.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu adali ta Galileya mosusu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luk 4, 42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Amaka ya busa na ihindihindi Yesu angɔɔ, ko aimana, ko akɛɛ ta etengelenge, iho, aɔngɔnɔkɔ. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Simona na binande bakɛɛ ahombe Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />ko bamotanea, bamotɔndea bo: «Bato basusu baohombakadea.» <verse eid="MRK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Endelo Yesu obala na bu bo: «Lokɛeni ta pamba ikina ta ngando dji mbuti, tina e botɔndea Bwɛndi Bopele iho pongono, modjɔ mo nadoa oko na tina imina.» <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Ko akɛɛ ta Galileya mosusu; atɔndeaka Bwɛndi Bopele ta ndako dji miɔngɔnɔ dji Bayudha ko abenganaka membo mibe.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asɛnodji moto omɔti o mabha</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat 8, 1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luk 5, 12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Moto o mabha omɔti adoa ta dii Yesu; akwa na magbunda ko amoɔngɔnɔ, amotɔndea bo: «Okapala, sɛnodjani.» <verse eid="MRK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Yesu amokea ndjokwa, aninodja ebɔ ko amobɛndjɛ. Amotɔndea bo: «Napalakadea modjɔ momina, sɛnɔɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Na mbala emɔti mabha ma nde masia ko aso asɛnɔ. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Ngɔngɔ dji mina, Yesu amotingea endɛndɛ ta itoi, ko na mbala emɔti amoyanedja. <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />Ko abala na nde bo: «Keba, pɛpɛ botɔndea moto eka emɔti. Endelo kɛɛ asainedje ta dii nganga o Ndjakomba, ko pa mabondja maboinedja bo osɛnɔi, mondumba moloma Mose, ko edaadea tati ta dii ibo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Lew 14.2-32</char></note>.» <verse eid="MRK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Endelo moomi omina akɛɛ atɔndoe pamba djisusu ko ta dii moto mosusu eka esusu enɔmɔ. Na tina emina Yesu aimanaka naikina ta ngando enɛnɛ, adikamaka oko ta bitengelenge. Ko bato badongaka pamba na pamba bamokimanaka.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s">Yesu atingoi moto o mako makatatake</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat 9, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk 5, 17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Ngɔngɔ dji masu, Yesu asɔmbɔ ta Kapalanaume, ko bato baso baoka bo adaaka ta ndako<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta ndako: Bobwana na Mal 1.29, ebwani bolɛnɛmɛ edi ndako e Simona ko Andele.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Bato banɛnɛ baputoana, esika e bonɔ eidaka, nongo ta modipe mo ndako ndjea e bokwea eidaka. Ko abatɔndeaka Bwɛndi Bopele. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Bato badoa na moto omɔti iyo odaaka na binama bikatatake: Bato banɛi bakɛkɛ amosonge. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Endelo baihɔnɔkɔ boimea na nde ta dii Yesu elɔke tingi na emumu e bato, baiwea na nde ta diko di etondo, batɔɔ ipose ta diko di etondo ta esika edaaka iyo aemi ko batitedja moto o mako makatatake iyoyo odaaka asambi ta bokaki. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Yesu aɛnɛ edhimeli e bobo, abala na moto o mako makatatake bo: «Mwana o mbi, pekato dji wɛ djikutubani.» <verse eid="MRK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Bakina balehi ba mobeko badaaka ena na mobondo, balɛdjɛkɛ modjɔ momina ta nase dji milema bo: <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />«Tina ndani moto iyo abalakadea ibobo? Atsiolakadea Ndjakomba! Omina obwani bokutubanedja pekato nda? Emiti daa oko Ndjakomba iyo mɛnɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bosinga Ndjakomba: Kuanedja Lew 24.16. Ndjakomba oyo mɛnɛ moto obwani: Boindja Ndjem 103.3; Es 43.25.</char></note>!» <verse eid="MRK 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Yesu na Mwembo asipoa ilɛno dji bobo, ko abala na bu bo: «Olɛdjini iboa tina nda? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Eka ndani enɔi na bopipo, bobala na moto o mako makatatake bo: “Pekato dji wɛ djikutubani”, kaoko bobala bo: “Sangɔdjɔ, tomba bokaki bo wɛ ko kɛɛ”? <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Ekahia djebani bo: Mwana o moto adii na bokondji bo bokutubanedja pekato dji bato iyaya ta kpɔtɔ.» Iboa Yesu abala na moto o mako makatatake bo: <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />«Naotɔndei bo: angɔɔ, tomba bokaki bo wɛ, ko yana ta ndako e wɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Moto omina asangɔdjɔ, na mbala emɔti andoa bokaki bo nde, aimana ta boso bo bato basusu. Ko bato basusu bakamoa ko bakumedjaka Ndjakomba, ko babalaka bo: «Lopakinaenɛ modjɔ mondumba imumu.»<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu abei Lewi</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat 9, 9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk 5, 27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Yesu akɛɛ na ikina mbuti na ibeke. Emumu e bato edoaka tadii iyo ko abalehaka. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Anɔɔ iyo ena, aenɛ Lewi, mwana o Alipe adii ta bilo e puti. Abala na nde bo: «Kimanani!» Lewi aangɔ ko amokimana. <verse eid="MRK 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Iyana, ayakaka Yesu mia ta ndako e Lewi, baputedji ba puti, ko na bato ba pekato banɛnɛ, badaaka na Yesu ta mesa na batingami ba nde, modjɔ mo badaaka ibo banɛnɛ ko bamokimanaka. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Ko balehi ba mobeko ibia badaaka ta tei e Bapalisai, baɛnɛ Yesu ayaka na bato ba pekato ko na baputedji ba puti; bawadjaka na batingami ba nde bo: «Tina ndani iyo ayakakadea na baputedji ba puti ko na bato ba pekato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuanedja ta molɔngɔ mo 15.16 ko Luk 15.1-2.</char></note>?» <verse eid="MRK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Yesu aoka mɛko mimina, abala na bu bo: «Bato ba bipeko batungi badie monganga, endelo bato bamikuku mipele batungiti badie monganga. Naidoa ahomba bato ba bodju, endelo nadoa ta tina e bato ba pekato.»<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ko na mongilo</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat 9, 14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk 5, 33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Busa bomɔti, batingami ba Yoane Mobatisi ko Bapalisai bakɔkɔ mongilo. Bato badoa awadja Yesu bo: «Tina ndani batingami ba Yoane ko na ibia Bapalisai bakakɔe mongilo, tina ndani ibi ba wɛ te bakoe boa?» <verse eid="MRK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Bato bakabeebo a tɛkɛ e moki babwani bokɔɔ mongilo kaoko bowɛ ndja ndelo edii ibo na moomi? Ndelo edii bo na moomi polo emɔti, babwaniti bokɔɔ mongilo. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Endelo ta masu ma ngɔngɔ madongedjabi bo moomi, ndelo emina iyena bakɔbi mongilo.<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />«Te batonge epasa esendja eyeene na esendja eyou; emiti daa iboa epasa esendja eyeene ealadea esendja eyou ko ipese dimina imeadea naikina inɛnɛ. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Te baise vino eyeene ta mbola djiyou; emiti daa iboa, vino ealadea mbola imina: vino esopeadea ko mbola djialeadea pongono. Endelo bakaise vino eyeene oko ta mbola djiyeene!»<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ko na busa bo sabata</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk 6, 1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Ta busa bo sabata, Yesu anɔkɔ mbuti na gbie e mbuma dji ble ko na ndjea, batingami babanga batswa mbuma dji ble<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta Dit 23.26.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Bapalisai babalaka na Yesu bo: «Indja tina ndani batingami ba wɛ bakɔkɔdea midjɔ misiama ta busa bo sabata<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta Mba 34.21.</char></note>?» <verse eid="MRK 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Abasɔmbedja bo: «Oilangani modjɔ mokɔ Dhapiti ehole e taka yo ko eoka yo ndja na bato badalaka na nde? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Akweya ta ndako e Ndjakomba, ta ehole e nganga o Ndjakomba o monɛnɛ Abiatala ko ayaka mwɛmbɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ayaka mwɛmbɛ... Boindja 1 Sam 21.2-7. Abiatala: Boindja ta 2 Sam 15.15.35. Mapama ndjea oko na banganga ba Ndjakomba: Boindja Lew 24.9 </char></note> mo bondjeaka ibo Ndjakomba, pɛpɛ moto omɔti odaaka na bokondji bo bomayaka, dongedja oko banganga ba Ndjakomba, ko Dhapiti apaka pongono na bato ba nde.» <verse eid="MRK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Yesu abatɔndea na ikina bo: «Busa bo sabata bokɔmɔ tina e moto, endelo moto aikɔmɔ tina busa bo sabata. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Ta tina e mina Mwana o moto adii mɛɛnɛ moswa busa bo sabata.»<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji moto a busa bo sabata</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12, 9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk 6, 6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Ngɔngɔ djimina Yesu akweya na ikina ta ndako e miɔngɔnɔ mi Bayudha. Iho moto o ebɔ ekatatake adaaka ena. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Basɛndjɛlɛkɛ Yesu singandolo akamoheledja ta busa bo sabata, bɛngi bomopunde. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Yesu abala na moto odaaka na ebɔ e ekatatake bo: «Saangɔdjɔ! Ema iyana boso bo bato basusu.» <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Ngɔngɔ dji mina, awadja bato badaaka ena ibo: «Eka ebwani bokɔɔmɔ ta busa bo sabata nda? Edii bokɔɔ bopele kaoko bokɔɔ bobe? Boheledja kaoko boowa moto?» Endelo ibo baipala bosɔmbedja. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Yesu abaindja ibo basusu na miso ma kɛlɛ, aoka ndjokwa enɛnɛ tina e milema mi bobo mipipo, abala na moto omina bo: «Ninodja ebɔ e wɛ.» Aninodja ebɔ e nde ko eso ehela. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Bapalisai baimana ko na mbala emɔti baputoana na bato ba iputo di Elode<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bato ba iputo di Elode: iputo dimina idaka di bato bapalaka Elode Atipasi (yanga e 4 boso bo Yesu bobotama mbunoko ta yanga e 39 ngɔngɔ dji Yesu). Bato bamina bahombaka omɔti o batitani o mokondji Elode o Monɛnɛ akondje ta tei e bobo ta esika e gupɛlɛnɛlɛ o Loma.</char></note> bɛngi bahombe ndenge ebwani na bu bowa Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ta ndanda e emumu e bato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Yesu adonga na batingami ba nde ko bakɛɛ ta mokula mo ibeke, ko emumu e bato bamokimana badonga ta Galileya ko na Yudha, <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />Donga ta Yelusalɛmɛ, na Idume<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Idumɛ: Ekenge iyena e mokili edaka ta satina e Yudhaedaka na ngando enɛnɛ e Ebɔlɔne.</char></note>, ko na telitoale edaka ta ngunda e Yɔlɔdane, ko na ekenge e mokili e Tile na Sidona. Emumu e bato edoa ta dii Yesu, modjɔ mo baokaka gala e mɛko misusu mikɔɔkɔ iyo. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Iboa aloma batingami ba nde bamobɔngedje bwato modjɔ mo emumu e bato esaka mombambamedja. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Na tina emina Yesu aheledjaka bato banɛnɛ ko bato basusu badaaka na bego basweanaka bɛngi bamobɛndjɛe. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Ndelo eɛnɛkɛ bato ba membo mi pita Yesu basadumbaka ta mako ma nde, bagamaka na ngulu bo: «Wɛ, odii Mwana o Ndjakomba!» <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Endelo abatubaka matoi badae pɛpɛ botɔndea eka edii iyo.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahɔi bapɔsɔlu doomi na babae</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat 10, 1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk 6, 12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Ngɔngɔ djimina Yesu aiwea ta ngomba; ko abea ibia bapalaka iyo ko badoa ta dii iyo. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Abea batingami doomi na babae bapa iyo kombe e bapɔsɔlu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Makina makomi maditi na kombe e bakeyo bapɔsɔlu.</char></note> bɛngi bo adae na bu ko abalome atɔndea Bwɛndi Bopele, <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />na kpati e bobengana membo mibe. <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Indja bapɔsɔlu bamina doomi na babae: Simona, amobakea kombe e Petelo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kombe e Petelo: Kuanedja Mat 16.16-18; Yoa 1.42.</char></note>, <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Djake mwana o Djebede ko na Yoane mina nde, ibo Yesu ababakea kombe e: Boenɛlɛgesi, epalakadea bobala bo: «Bato bakuana na kake<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuanedja a Luk 9.54.</char></note>», <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Andele, Pilipo, Batelemi, Matayo, Tomasi, Djake, mwana o Alipe, Tade Simona, moto iyoyo ohombaka lipandasi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ ta Mat 10.4 ko na nase; Luk 6.15.</char></note>, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />na Yudhasi Isikaliote, iyo omotɛkɛ.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibota di Yesu idoi amotomba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Ehole esɔmbɔ Yesu bokwea ta ndako, emumu e bato ebolama naikina, ko Yesu na batingami ba nde baidiaka enɔli e boyaka. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Ehole eoka bato ba ibota di nde gala emina, badoa amotomba. modjɔ mo babalaka bo: «Akɔni igboma!»<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asɔmbedji ta pundi dji mopunda ibo</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Mat 12, 22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk 11, 14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12, 10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Ko balehi ba mobeko ibia badonga ta Yelusalɛmɛ, babalaka bo: «Adii na Bɛlɛdjɛbule<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bɛlɛdjɛbule: Boindja Mat 10.25 ko ta nase.</char></note>.» Ko: «Edii mokondji o membo mibe; okamopɛ kpati e bobengana membo mibe!» <verse eid="MRK 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Iboa, Yesu ababea ko abatɔndea na bikuanedji bo: «Ndenge ndani satana abwani bobengana mina nde Satana? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Bokumu bomɔti bokabɔtɔ ta tei e bu, bobwaniti boema; <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />ko bato ba ibota di mɔti bakabɔtɔ, ibota dimina iboaniti boema. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Ko Satana akasanedja iyo mɛnɛ, kaoko akasakabana, bopilo bo nde bobwani bosia, ata yeyoa na ikina. <verse eid="MRK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />Moto abwaniti bokweya ta ndako e moto o ngulu ko bokatoa leka lo nde, amiti pea moto o ngulu boso; ngɔngɔ imina atombadea leka lo nde lo ndako. <verse eid="MRK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />Sooti, naotɔndeakani bo: pekato djisusu dji bato djikutubanabi ko na masinga masusu masinga bo Ndjakomba. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />Endelo moto akatuka Mwembo Mosɛnɔke, pekato dji nde djibwaniti bokutubana, alwabi muna mo pekato emina mbunoko kɔbili na kɔbili.» <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Yesu abakebedja tina e bo babalaka na nde bo: «Adii na mwembo mo pita.»<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bangi Yesu na nango</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12, 46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk 8, 19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Bangi i Yesu na ngwabu baimea ta polo adaaka iyo. Baema sokolu ko baloma moto omɔti amobee. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Bato banɛnɛ badaaka na mobondo bamohiki. Bamotɔndea bo: «Ngwao na bana ba ngwao ba baami badii sokolu ko bakambakadea baoɛnɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Abasɔmbedja bo: «Odii nange o mbi nda ko baangi i mbi ba nda?» <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Ko, ahokodja miso diko di bato badaaka ba mohiki, abala na bu bo: «Indja nange o mbi na baangi mbi. <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Modjɔ mo moto iyoyo odii bokɔɔ bolulea bo Ndjakomba, iyo adii mwange mbi, adii ngɛnɛ e mbi ko adii nange o mbi.»<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ekuanedji e moaneli o gbie</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat 13, 1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luk 8, 4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Yesu abanga boleha na ikina ta mokula mo ibeke. Emumu e bato banɛnɛ babolama mbuti na nde, na tina emina Yesu atitea ta bwato ko adaa na mobondo. Emumu e bato basusu badaaka o ngondo ta mokula mo ibeke. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Abalehaka mɛko minɛnɛ na bikuanedji ko ta eleho e nde abaleha bo: <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />«Hokamedjani! Moaneli omɔti akɛkɛ amɛsɛ mbuma ta gbie. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Enakoboa ta ehole eanaka iyo mbuma, djikina djikwaka ta ndjea: mbulu ba diko badoa ko bakoma mbuma dji mina djisusu. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Djikina mbuma djikwaka ta kpɔtɔ dji ndeke, mbuma djiitɔɔ pɛpɛlɛ modjɔ mo mokpɔtɔ momina moidaaka mo mbɛngɛ. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Endelo ta ehole eimana moi, moboma na ngulu ko djikakana ta tina e bo djiidaka na nginga. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Djikina djikwaka ta esika e ndjubɛ, ndjubɛ djikandoa, djimbambamedja mbuma djimina ko djiibota. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Endelo mbuma djindjua djikina djikwa ta kpɔtɔ dji bopɛtɛpɛtɛ; djitɔɔ ko djikandoa, djibota mbuma, emɔti ebota mbuma tuku isato, ekina mbuma tuku isamano, ko ekina mbuma mokama.» <verse eid="MRK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Ko Yesu aso abalaka bo: «Yɛɛ bo moto odii na matoi aoke!»<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tina elehaka na Yesu na bikuanedji nda?</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat 13, 10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luk 8, 9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Ndelo edaaka Yesu bohali na emumu e bato, babatingami ko na bato bakina badaaka mbuti na nde babanga bomowadja bo: Tina ndani okapale seko bobala na bikuanedji? <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Yesu abasɔmbadjaka bo: «Obolodjini sooti e midjɔ mi mbombi mi Bokumu bo Ndjakomba. Ekahia bakina bato baokakadea oto bikuanedji, <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />ta tina emina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">“baindjakadea, endelo bataenɛkɛdea,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">baokakadea, endelo batasipoakadea;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">baso badjeba babwani bosɔmbea Ndjakomba, ko iyo adii bokutubanedja pekato dji bobo!”»<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atingodji ekuanedji e moaneli</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat 13, 18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luk 8, 11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Ngɔngɔ dji mina Yesu abala na bu bo: «Otasipoakani ekuanedji iyeye? Iboa ndenge ndani esipoadea na nu bikuanedji idjidji djikina? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Moaneli aani Mobalo. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Mbuma djikina dji kwa ta ndjea edii wɛtoko bato ba kaoke mobalo mo Ndjakomba, endelo Satana akadoe adongedja Mobalo moanamaki ta dii bo. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Bakina bato bakuani na mbuma djikwa ta esika e ndeke: ehole eoki bo Mobalo bamoasɔi pɛpɛlɛ ko na mongandi. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Endelo moitɔ nginga ta dii ibo, ko bamobanei oto moo ehole mokɛkɛ. Iboa ikamba na minɔngɔ mika doa tina e Mobalo, na mbala emɔti badumbi edhimeli. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Bato bakina bakuani na mbuma idjikwa ta ndjubɛ: baoki Mobalo, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />Endelo bokɛi bo ngondo iyeye na bokoso bo bodieli ko posa dji mindumba mikina djikwei ta dii ibo djimbambamedji Mobalo, ko mobotiti nongo mbuma emɔti. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Mbuma djikina djindjua djikwa ta kpɔtɔ dji bopɛtɛpɛtɛ: edii bato ibia baoki Mobalo, ko bamoasɔi, baboti mbuma, emɔti eboti mbuma tuku isato, ekina tuku isamano ko ekina mokama.»<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ekuanedji e molinda</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luk 8, 16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Yesu abalaka na bu bo: «Moto abwani botomba molinda bɛngi amokunde na poke kaoko amoise nase dji bwako? Ediiti bo abwani bomobakea ta ebakeli e molinda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Mat 5.15; Luk 11.33.</char></note>? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Modjɔ mo midjɔ misusu mibolama mi imanabi ta bohu, ko mɛko misuu mi mbombi mihuodjamabi. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Moto odii na matoi ma booka, aoke!» <verse eid="MRK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Yesu abala na bu naikina bo: «Kebani na midjɔ imimi miokakadea ino! Ndjakomba aopadeani, oko mondumba momɔti mopakadea ino binanu; aokɔmeadeani kutu na bonɔ. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Modjɔ mo iyoyo odii na moeka bamobakeabi lokina leka, endelo moto odii pɛpɛ bopea nongo eka emɔti, bamokatoabi losusu lodaki na nde.»<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekuanedji e kona ekatɔe iyo mɛɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Yesu abalaka na ikina bo: «Bokumu bo Ndjakomba bobwani na moaneli omɛsɛkɛdea kona ta kpɔtɔ. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Bulu na moi moto omina awɛɛ kao adae mɔsu, kona emina edii botɔ ko bokandoa iyo pɛpɛ bodjeba. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Kpɔtɔ djo mɛnɛ idii boimedja: boso mɛnɛ esanga, ngɔngɔ djiimina mokekele, ko ta suka mbuma dji ble ilumi mokekele. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Ndelo epingi, mbuma djimina, baka kwe ta mosala mo bo dji lena na mbɛli iyeye akalene na bu mbuma dji ble modjɔ mo ndelo e bodji twa eimei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Yl 4.13</char></note>.»<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ekuanedji e mbuma e mutalade</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mat 13, 31-32</ref>.<ref loc="MAT 13:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luk 13, 18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Yesu abalaka bo: «Lodii boɛngɛ Bokumu bo Ndjakomba na ye? Ekuanedji ndani ebwani na su boɛngɛ na bu? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Bobwani na mombuma mo mutalade; ehole eonami mo ta mokpɔtɔ, modii mokɛkɛkɛkɛ bonɔ kona djisusu dji kpɔtɔ. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Endelo ngɔngɔ mokaonama ko mokatɔe ko mokaimee monɛnɛ bonɔ kona isusu dji ndjua. Mokaimedje tape djinɛnɛnɛnɛ ko mbulu ba diko babwani bokɔ moopo ma bobo ta esii e mu.» <verse eid="MRK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Yesu alehaka na bikuanedji binɛnɛ bobwana na mondumba momina, oto bɛngi bato bamookaka basipoe malɛi ma nde. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Adaaka abaleha bihole bisusu oko na bikuanedji, endelo ehole edikaka iyo na ba batingami ba nde, abatingodjaka mɛko misusu.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asii lungu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat 8, 23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk 8, 22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Ta mɔkɔmɔkɔ mo busa bomina, Yesu abala na batingami ba nde bo: «Lokatiseni ta ngunda e ibeke.» <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Bakina emumu e bato ko batitea na Yesu ta bwato bodalaka na bu. Engbanga emɔti na mato makina madaaka mbuti na nde. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Ko lungu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lungu: Ebwani pongono bobeama pweya.</char></note> edoa, bibuku bi mbonge bikweaka ta bwato, mbunoko bwato bolumaka na madiba. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Yesu adaaka awɛli ta mbaka e sangɔngɔ, abakea molo mo nde ta diko di kuse. Batingami ba nde bamosisodja, babala bo: «Molehi, iso lohombakadea logwe, modjɔ momina, wɛ omonɛkɛdea ngasa?» <verse eid="MRK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Asisoa ko, agamea mopɛpɛ abala na ibeke bo: «Pɔpɔnɔ!» Madiba ma emai bogo! mopɛpɛ mokini. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Yesu abala na batingani bo: «Odini mɛnɛ na bɔɔ tina nda? Odiitini naikina na edhimeli?» <verse eid="MRK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Ekahia ibo badaaka balumake na bɔɔ, basabaleanaka ibo na ibo bo: «Imumu mondumba mo moto nda? Edae bibuku bi mbonge na mipɛpɛ lomosumi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Ndjm 65.8; 89.10;107.23-32.</char></note>?»<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu atingoi moomi omɔti odaaka ne membo mibe</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8, 28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luk 8, 26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Baimea ta ngunda ekina e ibeke, ta ekenge e mokili mo Bagadaliɛniɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Malako apali boinedja iya bo ekenge e mokili edi ta dɔɔngɔ dikaimane modaakabusa a ibeke di Genedjalɛtɛ kaoko di Galileya. Bokuanedja Mat 8.28 ko ta nase.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Yesu aduboa ta bwato, ko mbala emɔti asongana na moto omɔti adaaka na mwembo mo pita, adongaka ta makila;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Makila mabɛmɛkɛ seko ta tei e mabanga manɛnɛ.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />moto omina adaaka seko ta makila ko moto omɔti aidiaka ngulu e bomonanga nongo mbɔti; <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />modjɔ mo mbala djinɛnɛ adikamaka seko mako matingamaki ta mosɔngɔ ko bamonangaka mbɔti, endelo adaaka abukakaka mosɔngɔ ko botwakaka mbɔti. Ko moto o ngulu o bomopea aidaka. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Bulu na moi, adaaka ehole isusu oko ta makila ko ta ngomba, agamaka ko asakwɛlɛkɛkɛkɛ pola na mabanga. <verse eid="MRK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Aenɛ iyo Yesu bohali, apota ebango ko akwa magbunda ta boso bo nde, <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />agama na ngulu bo: «Modjɔ mo mbi na wɛ nda, Yesu, Mwana o Ndjakomba Onɔi Diko? Naongɔni ta kombe e Ndjakomba, pɛpɛ bokɔɔni oko bobe!» <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Modjɔ mo Yesu abalaka na nde bo: «Wɛ, mwembo mo pita, imana ta tei e moto iyoyo!» <verse eid="MRK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Yesu amowadja bo: «Kombe e wɛ nda?» Iyo asɔmbedja bo: «Kombe e mbi “Ebole”, modjɔ mo lodii iso banɛnɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />ko amoɔngɔnɔkɔ na ngulu bo adae pɛpɛ bobengana membo mimina bohali na ekenge e mokili. <verse eid="MRK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Enakoboa, bwela bo ngulu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bobwana na Lew 11.7 ko Dit 14. 8, ngulu apeamaka na Bayudha o eka e djɛti ko na e bomoyaka. Isolo idi djinedji bo edi ta ekomi edii sokolu e Bayudha.</char></note> bodaaka ena mbuti na ngomba, bahombaka biyakea. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Membo mibe miɔngɔnɔ Yesu mibala bo: «Loloma ta dii ngulu ibiao bɛngi lokwe ta tei e bobo.» <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Yesu abapa ndjea. Iboa membo mi pita mimana, mikwea ta bwela bo ngulu ko badɔnga ta diko di ngomba na ebango ko bakwa ta ibeke, ngulu ba mina bakimanaka koto djibae<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2000</char></note> ko badinda ta madiba. <verse eid="MRK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Ibia babaneaka ngulu batiya ko bakɛɛ atɔndɔ modjɔ momina ta ngando enɛnɛ ko na ta miako. Bato badoa aindja midjɔ minɔɔmɔkɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Aimea ibo mbuti na Yesu ko baɛni moto o ebole e membo mibe adii na mobondo, alwai bisendja, iyɔngi di nde disɔmbi mɛnɛ, ibo basusu baso baluma na bɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Bato ibia baɛnɛ modjɔ momina ta mbangi, babatɔndea midjɔ misusu minɔɔmɔkɔ na moto otingoama na membo mibe ko na isolo di ngulu. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Iboa baɔngɔnɔ Yesu bo adonge ta kpɔtɔ dji bobo. <verse eid="MRK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Ndelo etiteaka Yesu ta bwato, moto otingoama na membo mibe, aɔngɔnɔkɔ Yesu, bɛngi akɛe na nde pongono. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Yesu aidhima, endelo amotɔndea bo: «Yana ta ndako e wɛ, ta ibota di wɛ, batɔndea modjɔ mosusu miokɔi Kumu ko na pɛhɛ e nde.» <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Moomi omina akɛɛ ko abanga botɔndea ta tei e Dekapole<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dekapoli: edi ekenge e mokili e putoandejakadea ngando djinɛnɛnɛnɛ Doomi edaka ta pamba satina ko dɔɔngɔ dikaimane modaaka busa ta ibeke di Genedjaletɛ.</char></note> mɛko misusu mimokɔmea Yesu; bato basusu baoka bakamoa.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwana mwali o Yailo ko na mwali o bɛndjɛɛ esendja e Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9, 18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk 8, 40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Ehole e sombɔ Yesu ta bwato, ayana ta ngunda e ibeke, emumu e bato baputoana mbuti na nde. Adaaka ta mokula madiba. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Mobanei omɔti ta tei e babanei ba ndako e miɔngɔnɔ mi Bayudha adoa, kombe e nde Yailo. Aɛnɛ yo Yesu, asadumba ta mako ma nde, <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />ko amoangɔnɔ na ngulu bo: «Mwana o mbi o mwali adii mbuti na bogwa, doa o mobakee mɔmɔ bɛngi ahele ko adae na bomɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Yesu akɛɛ na nde engbanga emɔti; emumu e bato bamokimanaka ko bamombambamedjaka pamba djisusu. <verse eid="MRK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Edaaka ena , mwali omɔti adaaka na yogo e botanga makiya ko ayeyoa na yu bianga doomi na ibae. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Anɔgɔmɔkɔ na epeko emina bobuke mɛnɛ ko abedjaka palanga dji nde djinɛnɛ ta dii minganga ko aihela nongo mweka, ekahia epeko engalaka oko bongala. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Mwali omina, aokaka iyo gala e Yesu. Aso adoa ngɔngɔ, ta ndanda e emumu e bato ko abɛndjɛ esendja e Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Modjɔ mo asabaleaka bo: «Nakabɛndjɛ nongo oto esendja e nde, naheladea.» <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Na mbala emɔti, yogo e makiya ekina boimana, ko ambuku asaokea ta mokuku mo nde bo ahelaka na epeko e nde. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Oko ta ehole emina, Yesu aoka bo ngulu emɔti eimanaka atei e nde. Asahokodja ta ndanda e emumu e bato ko awadja bo: «Osabɛndjɛni ta esendja nda?» <verse eid="MRK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Batingami ba nde bamosɔmbedja bo: «Wɛ onɛkɛdea emumu e bato baohiki pamba djisusu ko owadjakadea bo: “Osabɛndjɛni ndani?” » <verse eid="MRK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Ekahia Yesu aindjaka mbuti na nde bɛngi bo adjebe mwali omina okɔi mɛko mimina. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Iboa, mwali omina, aso aluma na bɔɔ ko na mongongoma, tine bo adjeba modjɔ mokɔɔmɔ na nde, aso akɛɛ asadumba ta mako ma nde ko amotɔndea bosooti bosusu. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Endelo Yesu amotɔndea bo: «Mwana o mbi o mwali, Edhimeli e wɛ eoheledji; kɛɛ na bogo ko hela na epeko e wɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Ehole abalaka Yesu naikina, bato bandako e mobanei o ndako e miɔngɔnɔ baimea bamotɔndea bo: «Mwana o wɛ o mwali agwi, tina e botungea molehi naikina nda?» <verse eid="MRK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Ekahia, Yesu aikipa mibalo mi bobo, atɔndea mobanei o ndako e miɔngɔnɔ bo: «Pɛpɛ bobanga, endelo daa oto na edhimeli.» <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Yesu aso asia pɛpɛ moto omɔti bokɛ na nde, dongedjaka ko Petelo, Djake na Yoane, mwange Djake. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Baimea ta ndako e mobanei o ndako e miɔngɔnɔ. Yesu aɛnɛ mongangale, bato badaaka bayea biyo ko ba lɛbɛ. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Akwea ta ndako ko abala na bu bo: «Tina ndani e mongangale ko biyo bo? Mwana agwiti, awɛi hiɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Endelo bamosɛkɛ. Iboa, aimanedja bato basusu sokolu ko adika oto na sange e mwana, na nange e nde na batingami ibia badaaka na nde. Akwea ta esika edaka mwana. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Apea ebɔ e mwana ko abala na nde bo: «Talita kumi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Talita kumi: Kombe dji bae dji alameɛ; alameɛ edaka kɔpi ebalamaka na Bayudha ta ehole e Yesu.</char></note>!» Etingodjakadea bo: «Mwana mwali, naotɔndeakadea bo: sisoa.» <verse eid="MRK 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Na mbala emɔti mwana asangɔdjɔ ko abanga bodala, modjɔ mo adaaka na bianga doomi na bibae. Na mbala emɔti ibo basusu baso bakamoa bobuke. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Ekahia Yesu abakebedja na ngulu bo badae pɛpɛ botɔndea bato modjɔ momina, ko abala na bu bo: «Mopani miya ma boyaka.»<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Bato ba Nadjalɛtɛ baloni bodhimea Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat 13, 53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk 4, 16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Yesu akina esika emina, adoa ta ngando enɛnɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngando enɛnɛ: Edii wɛtoko Nadjalɛtɛ. bokuanedja Mat 13.54 ko ta nase.</char></note> e nde mɛnɛ ko batingami ba nde baso bamokimana. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Ta busa bo sabata, abanga boleha ta tei e ndako e miɔngɔnɔ e Bayudha. Ko ebole e bato bamookaka bakamoa. Ko basawadjaka bo: «Adiakadea iyo mɛko imimi djɔ? Ko omina osamopa konga emina nda, ko na kpati e bokɔ midjɔ mi bokamoa na mabɔ ma nde? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Adiiti moaleli o mabaya, iyo te mwana o Malia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bokuanedja Yoa 6.42. </char></note> ko mwange Djake, o Yosepu, o Yudhe ko na Simona? Ko ngɛnɛ dji nde badiiti na su iyaya?» Ko mawadja mamina madaaka tina e bobo ndjea e bolona bomodhimea. <verse eid="MRK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Iboa Yesu abatɔndea bo: «Bakadimee motɛli pamba djisusu dongedja oko ta ngando e nde, ta dii denga di nde ko ta ndako e nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bokunedja Luk4.24; Yoa 4.44.</char></note>.» <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Yesu aihɔnɔkɔ bokɔɔ modjɔ mo bokamoa momɔti iyana, dongedja oko aheledja ndambo e bato ba bego na bobabakea mɔmɔ. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Ko akamoaka na taka e edhimeli e bato ba ngando enɛnɛ e nde.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 6:6">Yesu alomi batingami doomi na babae</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat 10, 5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk 9, 1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Yesu akɛkɛ alehe ta ngando djisusu dji mbutimbuti. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Abea batingami doomi na babae. Ko abanga bobaloma babae babae, abapaka kpati e bobengana membo mi pita, <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />ko abapa mitindo bo: «Ta mɔɔngɔ mokɛkɛdea ino pɛpɛ botombani nongo eka emɔti, dongedja oko pango; pɛpɛ botombani mwɛmbɛ, edae tɔmbi, ko na palanga ta tei e mosenge mo bino. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Lwani sapato, ko pɛpɛ botombani bisendja bibae.» <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Abalaka na bu naikina bo: «Na ndjea, okakweani ta ndako emɔti ko bakaasɔni, dikamani oko ena tee ta boangɔ bo bino. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bobhubhola idutu dji bigbota edii embete e bosatuba. Etingodji bo molomami atombiti nogo eka emɔti e moto edae nongo idutu dji ngando enɛnɛ e bobo idji ikalimeaki ta sapato dji nde.</char></note>Ko ta ngando emɔti bamiti oasɔni kaoko bamiti okeani, okaimanani ena, bhubholani idutu dji bigbota bi bino: edaabi tati tina e bobo.» <verse eid="MRK 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Bakɛɛ ko batɔndea bato bo etungi bohombedja milema. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Babenganaka membo mibe minɛnɛ, ko basuowaka munɛ ta dii bato ba bego banɛnɛ ta melo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bokuanedja Djake 5.14.</char></note> ko babaheledjaka.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bogwa bo Yoani Mobatisi</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat 14, 1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk 9, 7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Mokondji Elode<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elode: Iya ebalakadea tina e Elode Atipasi, iyo okondjaka Galileya.</char></note> aoka babala ta tina e Yesu, tina kombe e nde eokamaka bobuke; ko babalaka bo: «Yoane Mobatisi asisoi ta tei e bato bago! Tina emina abolodji kpati e bo bokɔɔ midjɔ mi bokamoa.» <verse eid="MRK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Bakina babalaka bo: «Edii Eliya.» Bakina babalaka bo: «Edii motɛli omɔti obwani na batɛli bakina bayou.» <verse eid="MRK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Aoka Elode iboa, abala bo: «Edii Yoane olena mbi molo, edii iyo moto osasisoa!» <verse eid="MRK 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Modjɔ mo Elode apeaka Yoane ko amonanga mbɔti ta bɔlɔkɔ, ta tina etingi na Elodiade, mwali o mwanango Pilipo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pilipo: epali bobala Elode Pilipo, iyo ohelamaka ta Loma; abwaniti bokaokoma na Pilipo okina, iyo okondjaka Sedjale e Pilipo (boindja Mal 8.27).</char></note>, iyoo oasɔkɔ iyo. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Yoane atɔndeaka elode bo: «Mobeko mosii boasɔ mwali o mwangwao<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Lew 18.16; 20.21.</char></note>!» <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Elodiade amokeaka swɛ enɛnɛ ko akanaka amoowodje, endelo aimokokaka. <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />Tina ebo Elode adaaka abanga Yoane, modjɔ mo adjebaka bo adii moto o bodju ko asapaka na Ndjakomba ko amobaneaka. Adaaka aoka oko mɛko mi Yoane, atakaka bogo. Ekahia adaaka na posa e bomohokamedja. <verse eid="MRK 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Endelo busa bo enɔi bodiama ta tɛkɛ e bobotama bo Elode iyo akɔmedja mia manɛnɛ. Aso abea bakumu ba bokondji bo nde, bakondji ba basodha na bakulaka ba Galileya. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Mwana mwali o Elodiade adaaka abua ngɔmɔ ta ekenge e ndako ko asepedja Elode na bato babeyaka iyo ta tɛkɛ. Iboa mokondji Elode abala na mwana mwali bo: «Wadjani eka epalakadea wɛ, naopadea.» <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />ko Elode akata seleka bo: «Eka esusu ewadjadeani wɛ mbi, naopadea edae ndanda e bokumu bo mbi.» <verse eid="MRK 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Mwana o mwali aimana ta ndako ko awadja nango bo: «Nawadje eka nda?» Nango amosɔmbedja bo: «Wadja molo mo Yoane Mobatisi.» <verse eid="MRK 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Mwana mwali asɔmbɔ ebango ta dii mokondji ko amotɔndea bo: «Napalakadea edɛdiyeye opɛni molo mo Yoane Mobatisi ta saani.» <verse eid="MRK 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Mokondji asaokea ndjokwa, endelo tina e seleka ekata iyo ta boso bo bato babea iyo ta tɛkɛ, aihɔnɔ bolona. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Na mbala emɔti aloma soda ta ndako e bɔlɔkɔ bɛngi bo amolwɛ molo mo Yoane, soda akɛɛ, ko alena molo mo Yoane. <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />Aisa molo mo Yoane ta saani, amopa ta dii mwana mwali ko iyo amopa ta dii nango. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Ehole eoka batingami ba Yoane gala emina, badoa ko batomba ebembe ko baesambea ta ikila<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bandoa ebembe ko bakɛɛ aisa ta ikila: Etingodji bopusea. Boindja ta Mat 27. 59-60. Luk 23. 52-53. </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Yoa 19. 38-41.</char></note>.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ayedji baami koto itano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Ehole ehula bapɔsɔlu ta elomu e bobo badoa atɔndea Yesu mɛko misusu mikɔkɔ ibo ko milehaka ibo. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Yesu abala na bu bo: «Doani, lokɛe ta etengelenge, bɛngi osahemedjeni.» Modjɔ mo bato banɛnɛ badaaka banɔnɔ ena, ko Yesu na batingami ba nde baidiaka enɔli e boyaka. <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Batitea ta bwato ko bakɛɛ ta etengelenge. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Ekahia bato banɛnɛ baɛnɛ ndenge ekɛkɛ ibo ko badjeba polo ekɛkɛ ibo; bato ba ngando djinɛnɛnɛnɛ djisusu djidaka mbuti bapota mbango baimea ta polo emina boso bo Yesu na batingmi ba nde. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Ndelo eduboa Yesu ta bwato, aɛnɛ emumu e bato banɛnɛ. Abaokea ndjokwa, modjɔ mo badaaka ondingo bhata ibia bataki mobanei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Mits 27.17; 1 Bak 22.17; Edjek 34.5-6.</char></note> ko abanga bo baleha midjɔ minɛnɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Busa boimea mɔkɔmɔkɔ, batingami ba nde badoa ta dii iyo bamotɔndea bo: «Esika iyeye edii etengelenge ko busa bobangi bodipa. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Yanedja bato ibibi bakɛe ta miako ko na ngando dji mbuti mbuti bɛngi bakɛe ta somba leka lo boyaka.» <verse eid="MRK 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Bapani leka lo boyaka ino bɛnɛ!» Bamowadja bo: «Lokɛe ta somba leka lo boyaka na pata dji palanga mikama mibae<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pata emɔti e palanga ta ehole eyou ebwanaka na iputi di busa bomɔti di mosali o gbie. Boindja Mat 20.2.</char></note> bɛngi lobapɛ bayake?» <verse eid="MRK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Yesu abawadja na bu bo: «Odiini na miɛmbɛ meka? Kɛaindjeni.» Ta ngɔngɔ dji boindja, bamotɔndea bo: «Lodii na miɛmbɛ mitano, ko na swi babae.» <verse eid="MRK 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Iboa Yesu abaloma bo badedje bato basusu kiki na kiki ta diko di ndjani. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Bato badaa na mbondo bakina kiki e mokama ko bakina kiki e tuku itano. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Yesu atomba miɛmbɛ mitano na swi babae, angɔdjɔ miso ta busa, asakoa Ndjakomba, abuka mwɛmbɛ, apa na batingami bakabane na bato. Akabana pongono swi babae na bato basusu. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Moto na moto ayaka ndenge epalaka iyo. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Ko batingami baandoana bikenge bi miɛmbɛ na swi ba dikaka, mitinga doomi na mibae<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bokunedja 2 Bak 4.42-44.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Bato bayaka mwɛmbɛ badaaka baami koto itano.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu adali diko di madiba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Na mbala emɔti, Yesu aloma batingami ba nde batitee ta bwato na ikina, bɛngi banɔe boso ta ngunda e ibeke, ta ngando enɛnɛ e Betesaida, ta ehole emina, iyo mɛnɛ apalaka ayanedje emumu e bato.<verse eid="MRK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Ngɔngɔ dji boyanedja bato, akɛɛ ta diko di ngomba tina boangɔnɔ. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Ndelo edipa busa, bwato bodaaka ta ndanda e ibeke, ko Yesu iyo mɛnɛ adikaka ta o ngondo. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Aɛnɛ iyo bo batingami baana na kai, tina mopɛpɛ modaaka moabasɔmbedja ngɔngɔ, ta eyeli e busa, Yesu abanga bodala mɔndɔ ta diko di madiba, ahombaka abanɔe. <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Amoɛnɛ bo akɛkɛ adale ta diko di madiba, balɛdjɛkɛ bo edii modjidji ko bagama na ngulu. <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />modjɔ mo ibo basusu amoenɛkɛ bo, badaaka na bɔɔ bonɛnɛ. Ekahia Yesu abala na bu bo: «Daani bogo! Edii oko mbi; pɛpɛ bobangani!» <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Atitea ta bwato bodaaka bo, ko mopɛpɛ mokina. Batingami baso bakamoa bobuke mɛnɛ, <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />modjɔ mo, baisipoa midjɔ minɔkɔ ndelo ekabanaka Yesu mwɛmbɛ: milema mi bobo midaaka mipipo.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aheledji bato ba bego ta ekenge e mokili mo Genedjalɛtɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Ta ngɔngɔ dji bokatisa ibeke, baso baimea ta ibongu di Genedjalɛtɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 53 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ekenge mokili mo Genedjalɛtɛ: pɛpɛ ngomba ko epele ta kona ta dɔɔngɔ di satina ko na dɔɔngɔ di kaimane modaakabusa ta Kapalanaume.</char></note> ko basɛmedja bwato bo bobo. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Aduboa bo ta bwato, bato baso badoa adjeba Yesu mbala emɔti. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Ndelo eoka ibo bo Yesu aimie ta polo edaka iyo, iboa bato bakɛɛ pɛpɛlɛ atomba bato ba bego diko di makaki ta ekenge e mokili esusu. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Pamba isusu inɔkɔ Yesu, ta ngando, ko ta ngando djinɛnɛnɛ kaoko ta miako, bato badoaka amosambea bato ba bego ta bisika bi bwase, ko bamoangɔnɔkɔ bo abakine babɛndjɛe sɔngɔ e esendja e nde, ibia bamobandaka bahelaka ibo basusu.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s">Eleho ekina bakɔkɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Mat 15, 1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Bapalisai ko na ndambo e balehi ba mobeko badonga ta Yelusalɛmɛ, baputoana ta esika edaka Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Baɛnɛ ndambo e batingami ba nde bayaka mia na mɔmɔ ma pita, epalakadea bobala bo: pɛpɛ bososa mɔmɔ bobwana na bokɔkɔ bo bobo. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Modjɔ mo ta bokimana mibeko mi bokɔkɔ bo bobo, Bapalisai na Bayudha basusu babwaniti boyaka leka pɛpɛ bososa mɔmɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bokuanedja Luk 11.38.</char></note>, <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />ko ta ndelo ehuli bo ta djaando, baiyaka mia boso bo bosasɛnodja na madiba. Ko edii pongono na mibeko mikina misumaka ibo, ondingo mondumba mopele mo bososa kɔbɔ, teni, masasu ma bibende ko na bisambe. <verse eid="MRK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Na tina emina Bapalisai na balehi ba mobeko bawadja Yesu bo: «Tina ndani batingami ba wɛ bakayake mia na mɔmɔ ma pita ta polo e bo basume mibeko milokinea bokɔkɔ?» <verse eid="MRK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Isaya alonga ndelo etɛlɛ iyo ta tina e bino! Odiini bato ba ndango e mongi, modjɔ mo ekomama bo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">“Bato ibibi bakasumeni oto na poso dji monɔkɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">endelo milema mi bobo midii bohali na mbi.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Malako ma bobo madii ibo bokwea tina e mbi madii oto ma ngasa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:7">bileho bi bobo bikalehe ibo bidii oto bi mibeko mi bato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa 29.13, elangama ngɔngɔ dji mikanda miyou ekomama na monɔkɔ mo gɛlɛki.</char></note>.”<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Okinini mobeko mo Ndjakomba ko osumini bokɔkɔ bo bato.»<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />«Sooti mɛɛnɛ odumbini, mobeko mo Ndjakomba tina bobanea bokɔkɔ bo bino! <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Modjɔ mo Mose abala bo: “Suma sangwao na ngwao”, ko naikina “moto iyona obwani bobala bobe tina e sango kaoko na nango atungi bamowoe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Boi 20.12 ko Dit 5.16; Boi 21.17 ko Lew 20.9.</char></note>.” <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Ekahia ino okaleheni ibo ekadaa na moto omɔti akabala na sango isa nango bo: “Eka ebwanaki na mbi naopɛ edii Koloba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Koloba: edi kombe e alameɛ. Etingodji bo ibondja tina e Ndjakomba.</char></note>”, etingodjakadea bo “ibondja tina e Ndjakomba”, <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />ino opini mwana ndjea adae pɛpɛ bokɔ bopele ta dii sango kaoko ta dii nango. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Ino odongedjini mobalo mo Ndjakomba tina bokɔkɔ ibubu boinedjakadea ino. Ko okɔkɔɔdeani mɛko mikina minɛnɛ mi mondumba momina momɔti.»<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Leka ilulu lokaimedje moto na djɛti</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Mat 15, 10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Ngɔngɔ djimina, Yesu abea naikina emumu e bato, abala na bu bo: «Hokamedjanini ino basusu ko sipoani bopele bo: <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Eka ebwani bokwea ta tei e moto ebwaniti bomobedja, endelo eka iyeye ekadonge ta molema mo moto, edii bomoimedja djɛti. [ <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />Hokamedjani bopele, okadaani na matoi ma booka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Molɔngɔ imumu te modae ta mikanda mikina miyou.</char></note>!]» <verse eid="MRK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Ehole ekina Yesu emumu e bato ko aso ayana ta ndako, batingami ba nde bamowadja tina e ekuanedji emina. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Ko abala na bu bo: «Ino pongono, odiitini na bowɛi? Odjebakadeani bo pɛpɛ nongo eka emɔti ebwani bokwea ta tei e moto ko ebwani bomoimedja djɛti, <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />modjɔ mo leka lomina te lokweake ta molema mo nde, endelo ta sɔpɔ dji nde, boso bo bokɛɛ ta ndima?» Ta kɔpi emina, iboa Yesu abalaka bo leka losusu loboyaka lodii losɛnɔke<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Bik 10.9-16.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Abalaka naikina bo: «Eka ekaimane ta tei e moto edii iyena ekamoimedje djɛti. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Modjɔ mo ta tei e molema mo moto malɛno mabe makaimane: pite, iba, boowa, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />bɔɔli, boimboa eka e moto, bobila, bowɛi bobe, ndukeli, posa ebe, bobala bobe na minɔ, bosakumedja, bodaa elole. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Bobe bosusu ibua bokaimane otei bokaimedje moto djɛti.»<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwali omɔti mokɛndɛli adhimei Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Mat 15, 21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Yesu adonga ena, akɛɛ ta telitoile e Tile. Akwea ta ndako emɔti ko aipalaka nongo bo moto omɔti amodjebe, nongo iboa aihɔnɔ bobolama. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Modjɔ mo, mwali omɔti mwana o nde o mwali atungeamaka na mwembo mo pita aoka iyo gala e nde ko aso adoa akwa ta mako ma nde. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Mwali omina aidaka Moyudha, abotama ta Penesi e Silia. Angɔnɔkɔ Yesu abengane mwembo mobe ta dii mwana o nde mwali. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Endelo, Yesu abalaka na nde bo: «Pete kina boso bana bagole mia ma bobo; modjɔ mo, ediiti bopele botomba mia ma bana bɛngi osabee bana ba mbwa.» <verse eid="MRK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Mwali omina amosɔmbedja bo: «Kumu, nongo iboa, bana ba mbwa bakayake oko kua ikadumbe bana ta nase i mesa.» <verse eid="MRK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Iboa Yesu abala na nde bo: «Ta tina e mɛko misabala wɛ, kɛ, mwembo mobe moimani ta tei e mwana o wɛ o mwali.» <verse eid="MRK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Asɔmbɔ iyo ta ndako e nde atanea mwana asambi ta esambe, mwembo mobe mosia boimana na nde.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aheledji moomi omɔti o bohoka ko emimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Ngɔngɔ djimina Yesu akina telitoile e Tile ko anɔɔ ta Sidona, asɔmbɔ ta ibeke di Galileya abokatisa telitoale e Dekapole. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Bamolwɛ moto omɔti o bohoka ko emimi bamoangɔnɔ bɛngi amobake mabɔ. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Yesu amotomba, asasua na nde moo bohali na emumu, amoisa sapi ta matoi, amotswea masɔi ko abanda yeemi e nde na masɔi ma nde. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Ngɔngɔ djimina, aangɔdjɔ miso ta busa, amohuea mohuli ko abala na nde bo: «Epata<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Epata edi kombe e alameɛ etingodji bo: Dipoama.</char></note>!» etingodji bo: «Dipwama!» <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Na mbala emɔti matoi ma nde madipwama, Yeemi e nde etatoama ko aimea bobala bopele. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Yesu abasia bo adae pɛpɛ botondea moto omɔti, endelo nongo ko abasiaka iyo, batɔndɔkɔ oko gala e nde. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Bato bakamwaka bobuke mɛnɛ ko babalaka bo: «Mɛko misusu mikɔkɔ iyo midii oko mipele! Bato babohoka baokakadea ko bimimi babalakadea!»<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ayedji bato koto inɛi</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Mat 15, 32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Ta masu mamina, emumu e bato banɛnɛ baputoana naikina. Ko bato bamina baidaaka na mia maboyaka, Yesu abea batingami ba nde ko abala na bu bo: <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />«Mbi nalumi na pɛhɛ ta tina e emumu iyeye e bato, modjɔ mo badai na mbi masu masato ko bapeliti eka e boyaka. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Nakabayanedja na ndja ta dii ibo, bakina basendjoadea ndja na ndjea tina e bo bakina badongaki bohali.» <verse eid="MRK 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Batingami ba nde bamosɔmbedja bo: «Lodii iyaya ta edhu, lodiadea mwɛmbɛ bɛngi bayake ko bagole djɔ?» <verse eid="MRK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Yesu abawadja bo: «Odini na miɛmbe meka?» Bamosɔmbedja bo: «Sambo.» <verse eid="MRK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Iboa abala na emumu e bato badae na mobondo ta kpɔtɔ. Atomba miɛmbe mimina sambo, asakoa Ndjakomba, amilenakaka ko amipa na batingami ba nde bakabane na bato basusu. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Badaaka pongono na ndambo e baswi bakɛkɛkɛ. Yesu adjongoa swi bamina ko apa na batingami bakabane oko monduba momina momɔti. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Enako iboa, bayaka ko bagola. Batingami bandoana bikenge bi swi na miɛmbe imimi midikaka ko balumedja mitinga sambo, <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />enako boa bato basusu badaaka ena bakimanaka koto inɛi. Ngɔngɔ djiimina, Yesu abayanedja, <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />na mbala emɔti, atitea ta bwato engbanga emɔti na batingami ba nde ko akɛɛ ta ekenge e mokili mo Dalamanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bapalisai bawadji embete e bokamoa</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">Mat 16, 1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Bapalisai badoa ta dii Yesu baisana na nde kitɛ ahombaka bamopikee elambo. Bamowadja embete ebwani bodonga ta busa. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Yesu aoka djɔlɔ enɛnɛ ta mwembo mo nde ko abala bo: «Tina ndani bato ba mbota iyeye bapalakadea bowadja embete? Naotɔndeakadeani sooti bo: pɛpɛ nongo embete emɔti einedjamabi ta mbota iyeye!» <verse eid="MRK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Ngɔngɔ djimina abakina, atitea ta bwato ko akatisa ta ngunda e ibeke.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bole bokahalodje mapa bo Bapalisai ko na bo Elode</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Mat 16, 5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Batingami babosaka botomba mapa, ko badaaka oko na ipa dimɔti ta bwato. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Yesu abakebedja bo: «Kebani! Ko tomadingani na bole bo mapa ibubu bokabeebo levile bo Bapalisai ko na ibubu bo Elode.» <verse eid="MRK 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Batingami basatɔndeanaka ta tei e bobo modjɔ mo baidaka na mapa. <verse eid="MRK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Yesu adjeba malɛno ma bobo ko abala na bu bo: «Okatakani mapa obwanini botubanani tina nda? Opakitaasipoani oko? Opakitapeani oko? Odiini na milema mipipo? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Odiini na miso ko otanɛkɛdeani? Odiini na matoi ko otaokakadeani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bokuanedja Yil 5.21; Edjek 12.2.</char></note>? Ino otalɛdjɛkɛdeani: <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />Ehole ekabanakabi mbi miɛmbe mitano ta dii bato baami koto itano, oandoabini mitinga mi leka milumake meka?» Bamosɔmbedja bo: «Doomi na mibae<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Mal 6.35-44.</char></note>.» <verse eid="MRK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />«Ko Yesu awadja naikina ndelo ekabanabi mbi miɛmbe sambo ta dii bato koto inɛi, oandoanabini mitinga milumake meka?» Bamosɔmbedja bo: «Sambo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Mal 8.1-9. </char></note>» <verse eid="MRK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Iboa Yesu abalaka na bu bo: «Opakita sipoani oko naikina?»<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aheledji moto o miso mago ta Betesaida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Aimea bo ta Betesaida, balwɛ Yesu moto omɔti o miso mago ko bamoɔngɔnɔ bɛngi amobɛndjɛe. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Yesu apea moto o miso mago ta ebɔ, aimana na nde sokolu e ngando. Amotwea masɔi ta miso ma nde ko amobakea mɔmɔ ko amowadja bo: «Obwani boɛnɛ eka emɔti?» <verse eid="MRK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Adipoaka miso ko abalaka bo: «Naenɛkɛdea bato, nabaɛnɛkɛdea ondingo mele endelo badalakadea.» <verse eid="MRK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Yesu amobakea naikina mabɔ ta miso, moto omina aso amotingea miso ngɔngɔ imina aɛnɛ bopele mɛnɛ ko aso ahela. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Iboa Yesu amoyanedja ta ndako e nde ko abala na nde bo: «Pɛpɛ boyanako ta ngando.»<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petelo adhimi bo Yesu adii Masiya</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Mat 16, 13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk 9, 18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Yesu akɛɛ na batingami ba nde ta ngando idjidji mbuti mbuti na Sedjale e Pilipo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sedjale e Pilipo: Edi ngando enɛnɛ edi mbuti na molo mo ediba e Yɔlɔdane ekɔɔmɔ na Elode. Bakaebee busa bu Baniasi. </char></note>. Na ndjea, abawadja bo: «Bato bakabale bo mbi nadii nda?» <verse eid="MRK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Bamosɔmbedja bo: «Bato bakina bakabale bo: Wɛ odii Yoane Mobatisi, bakina bakabale bo odii Eliya ko ta dii bakina bo: odii omɔti o batɛli.» <verse eid="MRK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Ko Yesu abawadjaka bo: «Ko inoni okabaleni mbi nadii nda?» Petelo amosɔmbedja bo: «Wɛ odii Masiya.» <verse eid="MRK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Iboa, abatuba matoi bo badae pɛpɛ botɔndea moto.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atɔndei bogwa bo nde ko na bosisoa bo nde ta bogwa</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Mat 16, 21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luk 9, 22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Ngɔngɔ djiimina, Yesu abanga boleha batingami ba nde bo: «Etungi na Mwana o moto aoke saya enɛnɛ; aloname na basuku, na banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ, ko na balehi ba mobeko, ko bamowadea, ngɔngɔ dji masu masato, asisoadea ta bogwa». <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Abalaka mɛko mimina ta bohu. Iboa Petelo amobea ta ngungusa, abanda bomodosa. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Ekahia Yesu ahombana, aindja batingami ba nde, agamea Petelo na ngulu ko abala na nde bo: «Satana, kɛɛ bohali na mbi, modjɔ mo mɛko milɛnɛkɛ wɛ miditi mi Ndjakomba, endelo midii mi bato.»<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Ngɔngɔ djimina Yesu abea emumu e bato ko na batingami ba nde ko abatɔndea bo: «Moto akapala bokimanani, asalone iyo mɛnɛ atombe ekulusu e nde ko akimaneni. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Modjɔ mo, moto opalaka boheledja bomɔ bo nde abobungedjadea; endelo iyo obungedjadea bomɔ bo nde tina e mbi ko tina e Bwɛndi Bopele, aboheledjadea. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Ko tɛtɔ ndani ediadea moto akatomba ngondo esusu, ndelo ebungedji iyo bomɔ bo nde? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Eka ndani ebwani moto bopa bɛngi adie bomɔ? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Modjɔ mo moto obwani bookani sɔni ko na mibalo mi mbi ta miso ma bato ba mbota iyeye ibibi bakadae pɛpɛ bosuma Ndjakomba bapundji, Mwana o moto pongono abaokeabi sɔni, ehole eduabi iyo na ekumu e Sango engbanga emɔti na babwɛndi basɛnɔke.»<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Yesu abalaka na bu na ikina bo: «Naotɔndeakadeani sooti bato bakina badii iyaya bagwɛtedea boso bo boɛnɛ bodua bo Bokumu bo Ndjakomba na ngulu.»<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bosɔmbɔtɔnɔ bo Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Mat 17, 1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk 9, 28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Ngɔngɔ dji masu masamano, Yesu atomba Petelo, Djake ko Yoane, akɛɛ na bu ta diko di ngomba emɔti eyai, iho badaaka oko ibo bɛɛnɛ. Yesu asɔmbɔtɔnɔ ta miso ma bobo, <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />bisendja bi nde bimea bipu ipɛɛ, bingɛsɛkɛ na mondumba mo bo pɛpɛ nongo eka emɔti iya ta kpɔtɔ ebwaniti boimia iboa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 2 pi 1.1-18.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Na mbala emɔti, batingami basato baɛnɛ Eliya na Mose, basolaka na Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Iboa Petelo abala na Yesu bo: «Molehi, edii bopele bo lodikame iyaya. Lopike bikpangba isato, emɔti tina e wɛ, ekina tina Mose ko ekina tina e Eliya.» <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Aidjebaka mɛko mibalaka iyo modjɔ mo badaaka na bɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Itute dimɔti litita ibakunda ko kɔpi emɔti eimana ta itute bo: «Iyo adii Mwana o mbi oepaeli, mookani!» <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Oko ta ehole emina, baindja pamba isusu idaaka bo, baiɛnɛ moto, baɛnɛ oko Yesu na ibo bɛnɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Ndelo etitaka bo ta ngomba abasia bo badae pɛpɛ botɔndea moto mɛko mienɛkɛ ibo mbunoko busa bosisoabi Mwana o moto ta bogwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Babanea mɛko mimina, basawadjaka ta tei e bobo bo: «Epalaka bobala “bosisoa ta bogwa nde”?» <verse eid="MRK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Bamowadjaka bo: «Tina ndani balehi ba mobeko bakabale bo etungi Eliya adoe boso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Mal 3.32.</char></note>?» <verse eid="MRK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Abasɔmbedja bo: «Edii oko iboa, etungi Eliya adoe boso tina e bobɔngedja midjɔ misusu. Ekahia ndenge ndani ekomama bo etungi na Mwana o moto aoke saya enɛnɛ ko bamoenɛdea ngasa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Isa 53.3; Ndjem 22.1-18.</char></note>? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Tina mbi, nadii botɔndeani bo: Eliya adoa ehele ko bakɔɔ na nde mondumba mosusu mopalaka ibo, oko mondumba mokomamaka ta tina e nde.»<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aheledji mwana omɔti otungeamaka na mwembo mobe</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Mat 17, 14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luk 9, 37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Ehole eimea bo mbuti na batingami bakina, baɛnɛ emumu e bato babahiki ko balehi ba mobeko baisanaka kitɛ na bu. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Ehole eɛnɛ emumu e bato Yesu, bato basusu bakamoa ko bakɛɛ amoisea. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Yesu awadja batingami ba nde bo: «Modjɔ ndani mo owanakadea ino na bu?» <verse eid="MRK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Moto omɔti ta tei e emumu e bato amosɔmbedja bo: «Molehi, naolwɛi mwana o mbi moomi, atungeamakadea na mwembo mobe mo mosiyakadea bobala. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Mwembo mokamodumbe ndelo djisusu, modii bomodumba ta kpɔtɔ, mapuli madii boimana na nde ta monɔkɔ, abwani bosakokala, bokpɛkɛnɛ mino ko mokuku mo nde mokaimee mopipo. Naongɔnɔki batingami ba wɛ bo bamobengane, ko bahɔniti bomoimedja.» <verse eid="MRK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Yesu abala na bu: «Mbota e taka edhimeli! Nadikamabi na nu mbunoko ehole nda? Nabwani boikeani molema mbunoko ehole nda? Lwɛnini mwana omina iyaya.» <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Iboa bamolwɛɛ mwana. Ehole eɛnɛ mwembo mobe Yesu mobanga bopukusa mwana, akwa ta kpɔtɔ, ko abilingoanaka aimedjaka mapuli ta monɔkɔ. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Yesu awadja sange ende bo: «Epeko emina ebanga na nde ehole nda?» Amosɔmbedja bo: «Donga oko ta bwɛngɛ bo nde. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Mbala inɛnɛ mwembo momina mokamodumbe ta mosa kaoko ta madiba bɛngi agwɛ. Ekahia oka hɔnɔ bokɔɔ modjɔ momɔti tina etingi na su, lokea ndjokwa ko loheledja!» <verse eid="MRK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Tina ndani obali bo: kaoko obwani bokɔɔ modjɔ momɔti? Djeba bo midjɔ misusu mibwani bokɔmɔ ta dii moto odhimi.» <verse eid="MRK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Na mbala emɔti sange e mwana agama bo: «Nadhimi! Komedjani, modjɔ mo nataki e edhimeli.» <verse eid="MRK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Aɛnɛ Yesu emumu e bato babolami, agamea mwembo mo pita bo: «Mwembo mo bohoka ko mo emimi, naopi mitindo, imana ta tei e mwana iyoyo, ko pɛpɛ bosɔmbɔ naikina!» <verse eid="MRK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Mwembo mobe moimana ko mogama, modumbi mwana na ngulu mɛɛnɛ. Mwana moomi asendjoa mbuti na bogwa, ta mɛti na bo bato basusu babalaka bo: «Agwi.» <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Endelo Yesu amopea ta ebɔ, amoangɔdjɔ ko aso aema diko. <verse eid="MRK 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Ehole eyana Yesu ta ndako, batingami ba nde bamowadja iyo mɛɛnɛ bo: «Tina ndani iso lohɔniti boimedja mwembo momina?» <verse eid="MRK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Mwembo mobe mondumba imua mobwani boimana oko na miɔngɔnɔ.»<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atɔndei na ikina bogwa ko na bosisoa bo nde ta bogwa</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat 17, 22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43b-45">Luk 9, 43b-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Badonga ta esika edaaka ibo, bakatisa ta Galileya. Ko Yesu aipalaka bo bato bamodjebe. <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />Modjɔ mo alehaka batingami ba nde ko abalaka na bu bo: «Bakabadea Mwana o moto ta mabɔ ma bato, ko bato bamina bamowadea, ko ngɔngɔ dji masu masato, asisoadea ta bogwa.» <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Ekahia batingami baisipoaka kɔpi emina ko babangaka bomowadja mawadja.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Odii monɛnɛ nda?</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat 18, 1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk 9, 46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Baimea ta Kapalanaume. Ehole edaka ibo ta ndako, Yesu awadja batingami bo: «Modjɔ mowanaki nanu na ndjea nda?» <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Ekahia baimosɔmbedja nongo eka emɔti, modjɔ mo, na ndjea, baisanaka kitɛ bɛngi badjebe ta tei e bobo moto onɔi binande. <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Iboa Yesu adaa na mobondo, ko abea batingami doomi na babae; abala na bu bo: «Ekadaa moto omɔti opali aimee moto o boso, etungi na nde bodaa moto o ngɔngɔ ko aimee mosali o binande basusu.» <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Atomba mwana mokɛkɛ, ko amoemea ta ndanda e bobo, ko amopea ta mabɔ ma nde, abatɔndea bo: <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />«Moto iyona oasɔdea mwana mokɛkɛ na kombe e mbi, asɔi mbi mɛnɛ; ko moto odii boaso ni, asɔiti oko mbi mɛnɛ, endelo asɔi pongono Iyoyo olomani.»<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Moto odii pɛpɛ bololona adii o biso</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luk 9, 49-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Yoane abala na Yesu bo: «Molehi, loɛnɛkɛbi moto omɔti aimedjakabi membo mibe na kombe e wɛ, ko lohombakabi lomosiye, modjɔ mo aidakabi na su engbanga emɔti.» <verse eid="MRK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Endelo Yesu asɔmbedja bo: «Pɛpɛ bomosiani ngasa, modjɔ mo moto abwaniti bokɔɔ modjɔ mo bokamoa na kombe e mbi, ko ngɔngɔ djiimina, abale bobe na kombe e mbi. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Modjɔ mo moto odii pɛpɛ bololona adii o biso. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Moto iyoyo oopabini kɔbɔ e madiba ma bomwa tina e bo odiini bato ba Kilito, naotɔndeakadeani sooti bo, abolodjabi ibondo i nde.»<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kebani na pekato</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Mat 18, 6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luk 17, 1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />«Moto omɔti obwani bodumba mwana mokɛkɛ omɔti o ibia bakadhimeeni ta pekato, enɔi bopele tina e nde bomotingea ibanga dinɛnɛ dikasiane ibo leka ta dɔli ko bamodumbe ta ibeke. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Ekadaa ebɔ e wɛ eolomakadea ta pekato, elena; enɔi bopele bo okwee ta bomɔ bo kɔbili ebɔ emɔti, na bo okwee ta ipelu mɔmɔ mabae ta mosa imumu mokadae pɛpɛ bodimea. [ <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />“Iho, ngusu ibia bakadɛe mokuku te bagwɛ ko mosa te modimee<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Molɔngɔ mu moditi ta mikanda miyou minɛnɛ.</char></note>”.] <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Ekadaa eko e wɛ eolomakadea ta pekato, elena; enɔi bopele bo okwee ta bomɔ bo kɔbili na eko emɔti, na bo baodumbe ta ipelu na mako mabae. [<verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />Iho, ngusu ibia bakadɛe mokuku te bagwɛ ko mosa te modimee<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Molɔngɔ imu te modae ta mikanda miyou minɛnɛ.</char></note>.] <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Ko ekadaa diiso di wɛ ikahomba di olome ta pekato, didongedja; enɔi bopele bo okwee na diiso dimɔti a Bokumu bo Ndjakomba na bo okwee ta ipelu na miso mabae. <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />Iho, ngusu ibia bakadɛe mokuku te bagwɛ ko mosa te modimee. <verse eid="MRK 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Modjɔ mo moto mosusu anɔɔbi ta ndjea e mosa mo saya ko adiabi monana bɛngi asɛnɔe.<verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />«Monana modii eka epele; ekahia mokataka edjɛ, ebwani wɛ bokɔ na mu naikina nde? Dani na monana ta tei e bino bɛnɛ ko dani na bogo bakina na bina bu.»<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu alehi tina etingi na bodongedja mwali ta moki</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Mat 19, 1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16, 18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Yesu akina esika edaaka iyo ko akɛɛ ta ekenge e mokili mo Yudhea, ta dɔɔngɔ dikina di Yɔlɔdane. Emumu e bato baputoana na ikina ta esika edaaka iyo, ko abanga bobaleha oko mondumba momɛsɛnɛkɛ na nde. <verse eid="MRK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Bapalisai badoa ta dii iyo bɛngi bamopike elambo. Bamowadja bo: «Elomama bo moomi adongedje mwali o nde?» <verse eid="MRK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Mobeko moopani Mose nda?» <verse eid="MRK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Basɔmbedja bo: «Mose apa ndjea ta dii moomi bokoma mokanda mo bodongedja mwali o nde ta moki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Dit 24.1.</char></note>.» <verse eid="MRK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Iboa Yesu abala na bu bo: «Mose akoma mobeko momina tina e milema mipipo mi bino. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Ekahia ta mbangi e ngondo, “Ndjakomba ayoa moomi ko na mwali<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mba 1.27; 5.2.</char></note>”. <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />“Na tina e mina moomi akinabi sango ko na nango adikamabi na mwali o nde, <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />ko ibo babae baimeabi mokuku momɔti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Makomi makina maditi na kombe e bodikama na mwali.</char></note>”. Iboa, badiiti na ikina babae, endelo mokuku momɔti. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Na tina emina, eka eputoanedji Ndjakomba, moto abwaniti boebɔtodja.» <verse eid="MRK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Ehole esɔmbɔ bo ta ndako, batingami baso bamowadja na ikina tina e modjɔ momina. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Abasɔmbedja bo: «Ekadaa moto omɔti akadongedja mwali o nde ko asɔi mwali okina akɔkɔdea bɔɔli modjɔ mo akini mwali o nde o boso; <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />ko ndelo, ekini mwali moomi odaaki na nde ko akɛi moki na moomi okina, akɔi bɔɔli.»<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu adjongoi bana bakɛkɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat 19, 13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk 18, 15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Bato balwɛkɛ Yesu bana bakɛkɛkɛ bɛngi ababakee mabɔ, endelo batingami babadosa. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Ehole aɛnɛ Yesu iboa, aoka bobe ta molema ko abala na batingami ba nde bo: «Kinani bɛngɛ bakɛkɛlɛkɛ badoe ta dii mbi! Pɛpɛ bobasiani, modjɔ mo Bokumu bo Ndjakomba bodii tina e bato ibia badii na moda mo bobo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Mal 9.37.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Naotɔndeakani sooti bo: moto iyo odɛi pɛ boasɔ Bokumu bo Ndjakomba ondingo mwana mokɛkɛ, atabokweadea.» <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Ngɔngɔ djimina, abatomba na mabɔ ma nde; ababakea mɔmɔ ta melo ko abadjongoa.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Modieli ko na Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat 19, 16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk 18, 18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Ehole edalaka Yesu na ndjea, moto omɔti adoa ebango, akwa magbunda ta boso bo nde ko amowadja bo: «Molehi mopele, nakoe bo bɛngi nabolodje bomɔ bo kɔbili?» <verse eid="MRK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Tina ndani odii bobeani moto mopele? Moto mopele adiiti oko Ndjakomba iyo mɛnɛ. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Odjebi mibeko: “Otaowakabi moto, otakɔkɔbi bɔɔli, otaibakabi, atabalakabi tati e okuta na mina wɛ, otakɔkɔbi mina wɛ bobe, osumakabi sangwao ko na ngwao<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Boi 20.12-16; Dit 5.16-20. Pɛ bokosea moto na eka ende: kombe djimina djibae djiditi ta mibeko doomi ko djidi ta makomi imi makuana adi Matai ko adi Luk.</char></note>.”» <verse eid="MRK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Moto omina amosɔmbedja bo: «Molehi, nakasume mibeko misusu mi mina donga ta bwɛngɛ bo mbi.» <verse eid="MRK 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Yesu amoindja na epaeli, amotɔndea bo: «Otaki oko eka emɔti, kɛɛ, tɛkɛ leka lo wɛ losusu, pa palanga djimina ta dii bakwali, na ndjea emina obolodjadea bodieli bo wɛ ta busa; ngɔngɔ djimina doa ko kimanani.» <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Ekahia moto omina aoka iyo iboa, mokuku mo nde moɛmbɛ ko ayana na ndjokwa ta molema, modjɔ mo adaaka na bodieli bonɛnɛ. <verse eid="MRK 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Yesu aindja pɛmbɛni pɛmbɛni e nde, ko atɔndea batingami bo: «Edii bopipo na badieli bɛngi bakwee ta Bokumu bo Ndjakomba!» <verse eid="MRK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Batingami basatungea na mibalo mi nde. Endelo Yesu abasɔmbedja naikina bo: «Bana ba mbi, edii mɛnɛ bopipo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bopipo: Mikanda mikina minedji adi bia bakasapɛ sa na madieli.</char></note> ta bokwea ta Bokumu bo Ndjakomba! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Edii bopipo bɛngi kamela akwee ta ipese di tonga, ekahia enɔi naikina bopipo bɛngi modieli akwee ta Bokumu bo Ndjakomba.» <verse eid="MRK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Batingami bakamoaka bobuke ko basawadjanaka: «Ekadaa oko iboa omina moto ohelabi nda?» <verse eid="MRK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Yesu abaindja ko abala na bu bo: «bato babwaniti bohɔnɔ modjɔ momina, oko Ndjakomba, tina ebo eka emɔti enɔi Ndjakomba ediiti.» <verse eid="MRK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Iboa Petelo abala na nde bo: «Iso lokina leka lo biso losusu bɛngi lookimane.» <verse eid="MRK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Naotɔndeakadea sooti bo: moto akakina ndako, bangi dji nde, ngɛnɛ dji nde, nango, sango, bana ba nde kaoko gbie tina e mbi ko na Bwɛndi Bopele, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />abolodjabi ibondo bianga mokama bonɔ ta ehole iyeye edii iso: ndako, babina nde, bangɛnɛ, banange i bato, basange i bato, bana, kaoko gbie engbanga emɔti na minɔngɔ ko ta masu makɛkɛ adoe abolodjabi bomɔ bo kɔbili. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Bato banɛnɛ ibibi badii boso, basɔmbɔbi ngɔngɔ, ko ibia bangɔngɔ baimeabi bato ba boso.»<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atɔndei bogwa bo nde ko na bisisoa bo nde ta bogwa mbala e basato</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20, 17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk 18, 31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Badaaka na ndjea bɛngi bakɛe ta Yelusalɛmɛ. Yesu asuaka boso bo batingami ba nde. Batingami ba nde basatungeaka ko bato bomokimanaka badaaka na bɔɔ. Yesu atomba naikina batingami doomi na babae bɛngi abale na bu, ko abanga bobatɔndea midjɔ mikɔmɔdea na nde ngɔngɔ. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />Abala na bu bo: «Indjani lokɛeni ta Yelusalɛmɛ, iho bakabadea Mwana o moto ta mabɔ ma banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ ko na balehi ba mobeko, bamotitedjadea ta bogwa ko bamopadea adii bato badii pɛpɛ bodaa bayudha. <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Bamotabi, bamotweabi masɔi, bamobomabi mbalake, bamowabi, ko ngɔngɔ dji masu masato, asisoabi ta bogwa.»<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esengi e Yoane na Djake ta dii Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Mat 20, 20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Djake na Yoane, bana baami ba Djebede badoa ta dii Yesu. Babala na nde bo: «Molehi, lopalakadea o lokɔmedje na modjɔ mowadjakadea iso.» <verse eid="MRK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Yesu abawadja bo: «Epalakadea ino naokɔmeeni nde?» <verse eid="MRK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Bamosɔmbedja bo: «Ehole eimeabi wɛ ta ekumu e wɛ, olopɛ bisika bi bodaa mbuti na wɛ, omɔti adae ta ebɔ e wɛ e baami, okina ta ebɔ e bali.» <verse eid="MRK 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Endelo Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Otadjebakadeani eka ewadjakadea ino. Obwanini bomwaka keni e monɔngɔ emwabi mbi? Obwanini botomba batisimo ba saya batombadea mbi?» <verse eid="MRK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Ko bamosɔmbedja bo: «Lohɔnɔdea.» Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Keni emwabi mbi, sooti mɛɛnɛ ino omwakabini ko batisimo batombabi mbi ino obatombabini<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Bik 12.2.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Endelo ta tina e bodaa ta ebɔ ebali kaoko e baami, ediiti mbi moto otombabi meko emina, bisika bimina bidii tina e ibia bahɔmɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Batingami bakina doomi ndelo eoka bo mɛko mimina, basuboa na Djake na Yoane. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Iboa Yesu ababea ko abala na bu bo: «Odjebakadeani bo bato bakasainedje ondingo bakondji ba bikomi, bakainedje bokondji bo bobo ta diko di bato ko bakumu banɛnɛ bakaokedje bato ba bobo saya. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Endelo ta dii ino edae pɛpɛ bodaa iboa. Iyo opali bodaa moto monɛnɛ ta tei e bino, adae mosali o binande, <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />ko ekadaa iyoyo opali bodaa moto boso, adae mosali o bobo basusu. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Modjɔ mo Mwana o moto aidoa bɛngi bamosaleake endelo adua tina e bosalea bato ko bopa bomɔ bo nde ondingo ikabo tina e bato banɛnɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Mal 14.24; 1Tim 2.6.</char></note>.»<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aheledji Balatimayo moto ogwa miso</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20, 29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk 18, 35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Yesu na batingami ba nde baimea ta Yeliko. Iboa baimana ta ngando enɛnɛ engbanga emɔti na emumu e bato, moto omɔti ogwa miso kombe e nde Balatimayo, mwana o Timeo, adaaka na mobondo ta mokpɛngɔ mo ndjea, adaaka asɛngɛ bato leka. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Aoka iyo bo edii Yesu o Nadjalɛtɛ, abanga bogama bo: «Yesu, Mwana o Dhapiti, okeani ndjokwa!» <verse eid="MRK 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Bato banɛnɛ bamogameaka bo daa bogo, endelo iyo agama naikina na ngulu mɛnɛ: «Mwana o Dhapiti, okeani ndjokwa!» <verse eid="MRK 10:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Yesu aema ko abala bo: «Mobeani.» Babea moto o miso mago; ko babala na nde bo: «Sapingedja, ko sangɔdjɔ, aobeakadea.» <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Iboa, adumba mokoto mo nde, asapimbodja ko akɛɛ ta dii Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 10:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Yesu amowadja bo: «Epalakadea wɛ naokɔmee nde?» Moto miso mago amosɔmbedja bo: «Molehi, napalakadea bo naɛnɛ na ikina.» <verse eid="MRK 10:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Yesu abala na nde bo: «Kɛɛ, edhimeli e wɛ eoheledji.» Oko ta ehole emina asɔmbɔ boɛnɛ bopele ko akimanaka Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akwei ta Yelusalɛmɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21, 1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19, 28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoa 12, 12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Ehole eimea bo mbuti na Yelusalɛmɛ, ta ngando dji Betepadje ko na Betania, ta pamba e ngomba e mele mi Olive<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Betepadje: ngando edaka ta pamba e kaimane modaaka busa ta ngomba e mele mi Olive, ta baakilomɛtɛlɛ bakɛkɛ na Yelusalɛmɛ. Betania: ngando ekina, e mbuti na iye e boso. Ko ngomba e mele mi Olive edi ikoli imɔti idi ta pamba ekaimane modaakabusa ta Yelusalɛmɛ; egbɔtɔkɔdea na ngando enɛnɛ na ibɛngɛ di Sedɔlɔne. </char></note>, Yesu aloma batingami ba nde babae, <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />ko abala na bu bo: «Kɛɛni ta ngando iyeye eɛnɛkɛdea ino boso bo bino, ehole eimedea ino iho, otaneadeani mwana o tito okabee bo ane atingi na mokɔli, moto omɔti apakina konda ta diko di nde. Motingoani ko odoeni na nde iyaya. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Moto omɔti akaowadjani: “Tina ekɔkɔdea nanu iboa nda”? Mosɔmbedjani bo: “Kumu akambakadea na nde, endelo amosɔmbedjadea iyaya oko edɛdiyeye.”» <verse eid="MRK 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Bakɛɛ ko batanea mwana o tito okabee bo ane atingi sokolu mbuti na modipe na ndjea, ko bamotingoa. <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />Bato ibia badaaka ena babawadja bo: «Eka ekɔkɔdea ino ena nda? Otingoakadeani mwana o tito okabee bo ane tina nda?» <verse eid="MRK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Batingami ba basɔmbedja oko mondumba mo batɔndeaka Yesu, ko baso babakina bakɛe na nde. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Balwɛɛ Yesu mwana o tito okabee bo ane; babakea bisendja bi bobo ta diko di nde ko Yesu akonda ta diko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Djkl 9.9.</char></note> di punda omina. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Bato banɛnɛ baanda bisendja bi bobo na ndjea ko bakina balenaka tape dji mele djitɔtu ta gbie<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ondingo ta 2 Bak 9.13, edi tina etunda kaoko yobo ekandee bo ta bokumu.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Bato ibia badaaka boso ko na ibia badaaka sangɔngɔ badumbeaka bo: «Odjana! Adjongoame iyona odoi na kombe e Kumu! <verse eid="MRK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Bokumu ibua bokɛkɛ adoe bodjongoame, Bokumu bo kɔkɔ o biso Dhapiti! Odjana ta bisika binɔi diko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Djem118.25-26.</char></note>!» <verse eid="MRK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Akwea ta tepelo e Yelusalɛmɛ. Ngɔngɔ dji nde boindja bopele mɛnɛ midjɔ misusu midaaka mbuti na nde, akɛɛ ta Betania na batingami doomi na babae modjɔ mo busa boimea mɔkɔmɔkɔ.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alakedji mole mo pigi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Ngɔngɔ dji busa bomɔti, ndelo ekina bo Betania, Yesu aso aoka ndja. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Aɛnɛ na bohali mole mo pigi modaaka na kasa, ko akɛɛ aindja singandolo mokadaa na mbuma; endelo ehole eimea iyo mbuti na mole, amotanea pɛpɛ nongo mbuma emɔti, modjɔ mo eidaaka ehole emu e bobota mbuma dji pigi. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Iboa Yesu abala na mole mo pigi bo: «Moto ayaketebi na ikina mbuma dji wɛ». Ko batingami ba nde bamoka.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ta tepelo</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat 21, 12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk 19, 45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yoa 2, 13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Aimea bo ta Yelusalɛmɛ, akwea ta tepelo ko abanga bobengana bato batɛkɛkɛ na bato basombaka leka ta esika iyena; akukea mesa dji bato basɔmbɔtɔnɔkɔ palanga ko bidie bi bato ibia batɛkɛkɛ bimbenga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta esika yena: epali bobala bo ta ikanga imɔti ta tei e tepelo idaka idipoamake tina e bato ibia badaaka pɛ bodaa Bayudha. Basɔmbɔtɔni ba palanga papaka ndjea adi Bayudha badongaka sokolu bosɔmbɔtɔnɔ palanga dji bobo bɛngi basombe makabo ma bobo ko bɛngi bapute puti e tepelo.</char></note>, <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />ko asiaka bato ibia batombanaka leka, badae pɛpɛ bonɔnɔ ta tepelo. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Ngɔngɔ djimina, abaleha bo: «Ta Makomi, Ndjakomba atɔndei bo: “Ndako e mbi ebeamabi ndako e miɔngɔnɔ tina bato ba bikomi bisusu. Endelo, ino ohokodjini esabalaka e bapundji<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Isa 56.7; Yil 7.11.</char></note>!”» <verse eid="MRK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ ko na balehi ba mobeko aoka bo iboa bahombaka mwɛngi ndani mo boowa Yesu; badaaka na bɔɔ bonɛnɛ modjɔ mo emumu e bato bakamwaka na bileho bi nde. <verse eid="MRK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Ehole eimia busa mɔkɔmɔkɔ, Yesu na batingami ba nde bakina ngando enɛnɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta mohombedja mokina: Ehole eimea busa mɔmɔkɔ, Yesu na batingami ba nde baimanaka ta ngando enɛnɛ.</char></note>.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ko na mole mo pigi mokakanake</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Mat 21, 20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Aya busa, ehole edaka bo bakanɔe, batingami baɛnɛ mole mo pigi: mokakani tii ta nginga. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Petelo aso alɛnɛ mɛko minɔɔmɔ, ko abala na Yesu bo: «Molehi, indja, mole mo pigi imumu molakedjakabi wɛ mokakani mosusu.» <verse eid="MRK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Iboa, Yesu asɔmbedja batingami ba nde bo: «Daani na edhimeli ta dii Ndjakomba. <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Naotɔndeakadeani sooti mɛnɛ bo: Ekadaa na moto omɔti akabala na ngomba bo: “Donga iyaya, kɛɛ asadumbe ta dua”, ko amiti daa na kitɛ ta molema mo nde, ekahia akadhima bo modjɔ mobalakadea iyo modii bokɔɔmɔ, mokɔmɔbi oko iboa. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Na tina emina, naotɔndeakadeani bo: Eka esusu ewadjadea ino na miɔngɔnɔ, dhimani bo obolodjani, ko eka emina epamadea na nu. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Ko ndelo eemai ino diko tina e miɔngɔnɔ, okadaa na ikambo imɔti na minɔ, moyɛɛ bɛngi Sangwanu odii ta busa akutubanedje pongono pekato dji bino. [ <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />Endelo omiti yɛɛni binanu, Sangwanu odii ta busa atakutubanedjabi pekato dji kɔɔki ino<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Molɔngɔ imumu moditi ta makomi makina mayou. Boindja Mat 6.15.</char></note>.]»<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kpati e Yesu edongi djɔ?</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat 21, 23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk 20, 1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Yesu na batingami ba nde basɔmbɔ na ikina ta Yelusalɛmɛ. Ehole edaaka iyo akɛkɛ ahombane ta tepelo, banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ, balehi ba mobeko, ko na basuku badoa ta dii iyo. <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />Bamowadja bo: «Okɔkɔdea mɛko imimi na kpati e nda? Oopa bokondji bo bokɔɔ midjɔ mimina nda?» <verse eid="MRK 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Naowadjakadeani iwadja imɔti; okasɔmbedjadeanini, iboa naotɔndeadeani bokondji ndani bokɔkɔdea na mbi midjɔ mi mina. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Batisimo ba Yoane bandonga ta busa kaoko ta dii bato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Mal 14-5.</char></note>? Sɔmbedjanini.» <verse eid="MRK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Iboa baikoaka ta tei e bobo bo: «Lokasɔmbedjadea bo: “Ta busa”, alowadjadea bo: “Tina ndani oidhimakani Yoane?” <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Endelo lobale ngalingondo bo: “Edii bato bamoloma...”?» Na boa babangaka emumu e bato, modjɔ mo moto mosusu alɛdjɛkɛ bo Yoane adaaka motɛli mopele. <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Iboa, basɔmbedja Yesu bo: «Iso lotadjeba.» Ko Yesu asɔmbedjaka bo: «Mbi pɛpɛ, nataotɔndeakɔdeani kpati ndani ekɔkɔdea na mbi midjɔ mi mina.»<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s">Ekuanedji e baoneli babe ba gbie e vino</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21, 33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk 20, 9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Yesu abanga bobatɔndea na bikuanedji bo: «Moto omɔti aana gbie e mele mi vino; aehika, alongea mombɔndɔ ta tei e mabanga bɛngi aame mbuma i vino, ko apika djumbu emɔti eyai tina e bodjibanea. Ngɔngɔ djimina, aisa bato ibibi bakadjebe bobanea gbie dji mele mi vino<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Isa 5.1-2.</char></note> ko akɛɛ ta mɔɔngɔ. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Ehole ekpeta mbuma, aloma mosali o nde omɔti ta dii baoneli ba gbie bɛngi bamolomee i nde ibondo dji mbuma i vino. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Ekahia baoneli bamopea, bamoboma ko bamoyanedja mɔmɔ ngasa. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Abalomea naikina mosali okina; bamoboma ta molo ko bamosinga. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Abalomea na ikina mosali omɔti, bamobomaka, bamowa; ngɔngɔ djimina alomaka bato bakina banɛnɛ, ko bakina babaowa. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Adikaka oto na mwana o nde oepaeli. Amoloma moto o suka ta dii baoneli ba gbie ko alɛdjɛkɛ bo: “Basumadea mwana o mbi.” <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Ekahia baoneli ba gbie babaleana ta tei e bobo bo: “Indjani moto odaadea mosangoi! Doani lomoowoe bɛngi gbie e mele mi vino edike e biso!” <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Iboa bamopea, bamoowa ko badumba ebembe e nde sokolu e gbie e mele mi vino.<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />«Naboa, Yesu abawadja bo: eka ebwani bokɔɔ moswa gbie e mele mi vino nda? Iyo adoabi, aowabi baoneli ba gbie e mele mi vino ko apabi gbie e mele mi vino na bato bakina. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Opakina langani mobalo mo Makomi imumu mokomama bo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">“Ibanga idumba batongi ba ndako,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">imei ondingo ekwee di ndonga idia dipeli ndako esusu.<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Edii Kumu moto okɔɔ modjɔ momina, ko</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:11">edii modjɔ momɔti mopele mo bokamodja tina e biso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndjem 118.22-23.</char></note>!”»<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Bakondji ba Bayudha bahombaka mwɛngi mo bomopea, modjɔ mo basipoaka bo abalaka ekuanedji e mina tina etingi na bu. Endelo badaaka na bɔɔ tina emumu e bato ibia badaaka ena; iboa bamokina ko baso bakɛɛ.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Puti e kaisala</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22, 15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk 20, 20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Balomaka ndambo e Bapalisai ko na ndambo e bato ba iputo di Elode<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iputo di Elode: Boindja Mal 3.6 ko ta nase.</char></note> ta dii iyo bɛngi bamopikee elambo, ngɔngɔ dji misɔmbedja mi nde. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Badoa abala na Yesu bo: «Molehi, lodjebakadea bo wɛ odii moto o bosooti; ko tobange moto, toindje sokolu e bato, endelo okalehe na bosooti bileho bi ndjea e Ndjakomba. Lotɔndea etungi na su boputa puti e Kaisala? Etungi na su boputa kaoko ngasa?» <verse eid="MRK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Endelo Yesu adjebaka ndango e mongi e bobo, ko aso abala na bu bo: «Opikeakadeanini elambo tina nda? Doa ainedjenini pata e palanga emɔti.» <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Bamolwɛɛ pata e palanga emɔti, ko Yesu abawadja bo: «Epoya iyeye ko na kombe iyeye e nda?» Bamosɔmbedja bo: «E Kaisala.» <verse eid="MRK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Iboa Yesu abala na bu bo: «Pani na Kaisala midjɔ mi Kaisala, ko na Ndjakomba midjɔ mi Ndjakomba.» Ko baluma na bokamoa.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwadja tina e bosisoa bo bato bago</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22, 23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk 20, 27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Basadukai badoa ta dii Yesu. Edii ibo bato ibia bakadhimedje bo: Bosisoa ta bogwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Bik 23.8.</char></note> bodiiti. Ko bamowadja bo: <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />«Molehi, Mose akomaka tina e biso bo: “Moto omɔti akaada na mwange o nde ndelo egwi iyo ko akini mwali o bogwa aibota na nde, mwange o nde abwani bomotomba bɛngi abote na nde bɛngi mowei adie batitani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Dit 25.5-6.</char></note>.” <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Enakoboa, ibota dimɔti lidaaka na bana baami sambo. Mwana o boso asɔi mwali ko aibotaka na nde ko agwi. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Mwana o babae atomba mwali o bogwa ko aibota na nde. O basato oko mondumba momina momɔti, <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />ko bo basusu sambo basangoa mwali omina ko baibota na nde. Ngɔngɔ dji bobo basusu, mwali omina pongono aso agwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Ta busa bo bosisoa ta bogwa, ndelo esisoabi baago, mwali omina adaabi o nda? Modjɔ mo ibo basusu sambo baamoasɔkɔ!» <verse eid="MRK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Odiini ta tei e ibunga, edii tina e bo otadjebakadeani Makomi, odjebitini ngulu e Ndjakomba. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Modjɔ mo, ehole esisoabi bato bago, baami na bali batasɔnɔbi, endelo badaabi ondingo babwɛndi badii ta busa. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />A modjɔ mo bosisoa ta bogwa, opakina langani buku e Mose ta isolo di mole imumu modaaka mosa mobwana? Ndjakomba abala na Mose bo: “Nadii Ndjakomba o Abalayama, Ndjakomba o Isaka ko Ndjakomba o Yakobo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Boi 3.2,6.</char></note>.” <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Adiiti Ndjakomba o bato bago, endelo adii Ndjakomba o bato badii na bomɔ. Odiini mɛnɛ ta tei e ibunga.»<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mobeko monɔi mibeko misusu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Mat 22, 34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10, 25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Molehi omɔti o mobeko aokaka adaaka bo baisana kitɛ. Aɛnɛkɛ bo Yesu abasɔmbedjaka bopele; ko asalinda mbuti na Yesu ko amowadja bo: «Mobeko ndani modii boso bo mibeko misusu?» <verse eid="MRK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Indja mobeko monɔi misusu imo imu: “Hokamedja, Isalɛlɛ! Kumu, Ndjakomba o biso adii oko Kumu omɔti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kumu... Kumu: ta mohombedja mokina Kumu adi Ndjakomba o biso, Kumu omɔti. </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Otungi bopala Kumu Ndjakomba o wɛ na molema mo wɛ itombo, na elimo e wɛ itombo, na bowɛi bo wɛ itombo, ko na ngulu e wɛ itombo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dit 6.4-5.</char></note>.” <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Ko indja mobeko mo babae: “Otungi bopala mina wɛ ondingo wɛ mɛɛnɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lew 19.18.</char></note>.” Mobeko mokina mo bonɔ imia mibae modiiti.» <verse eid="MRK 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Molehi o mobeko abala na Yesu bo: «Edii oko boa, Molehi! Obali sooti: Kumu Ndjakomba adii oko omɔti, endelo okina Ndakomba adiiti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Dit 4.35.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Ko atungi bopala Ndjakomba na molema mo nde itombo, na bowɛi bo nde itombo, na ngulu e nde itombo, ko atungi bopala mina nde oko mondumba mokasapale iyo. Iyena enɔi botumba mbeka ko bomopa mabondja ma tito<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Ose 6.6.</char></note>.» <verse eid="MRK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Yesu aɛnɛ bo asɔmbedjaka ondingo moto o bowɛi, amotɔndea bo: «Wɛ odii mbuti na bokwea ta Bokumu bo Ndjakomba.» Ko moto omɔti aidoa amowadja modjɔ mokina.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masiya ko na Dhapiti</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat 22, 41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk 20, 41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Ehole elehaka Yesu ta tepelo, awadja iwadja bo: «Ndenge ndani balehi ba mobeko babwani bobala bo Masiya adii mwana o Dhapiti? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Modjɔ mo, Dhapiti iyo mɛnɛ aluma na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke, abalaka iyo mɛnɛ bo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">“Kumu Ndjakomba abala na Kumu o mbi bo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">Dua adae ta ebɔ e mbi e baami,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">mbunoko bo naise baloni ba wɛ ta tina dji mako ma wɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndjem 110.1.</char></note>.”<verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Dhapiti, iyo mɛnɛ akamobee “Kumu”: ndenge ndani iyo abwani bodaa mwana o nde?»</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 12:37">Yesu akebedji emumu e bato tina e balehi ba mobeko</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 12:37">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23, 1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luk 20, 45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Ko bato banɛnɛ bamohokadjaka na sepi. <verse eid="MRK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Yesu abanga bobaleha bo: «Kebani na balehi ba mobeko, ibia bapali bolwa mikoto miyai, ko bapali bato babaiseake ndese dji ekumu ta bisika bikabolame bato; <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />bakahɔe oko bidie bi boso ta ndako dji miɔngɔnɔ mi Bayudha ko bodaa ta melo mi mesa ta ndelo e boyaka. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Bakakatoe bali ba bogwa leka lo bobo losusu, ko ta ndelo emina, bakadɛe baɔngɔnɔ miɔngɔnɔ miyai miyai ondingo bato ba pele, ko odjebeni bo babolodjabi etumbu iyeye enɔi na bopipo!»<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikabo dipama na mwali mokwali ogwa na moomi</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luk 21, 1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Yesu akɛɛ adaa mbuti na etanda e mabondja, aindjaka mondumba modaaka bato baisa palanga ta etanda emina. Badieli banɛnɛ baisaka palanga djinɛnɛ. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Mokwali mwali o bogwa omɔti adoa aisa pata dji palanga djikɛkɛkɛ djibae dji pɛpɛ tɛtɔ enɛnɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta ikomi di mbangi ekomama iya pata ibae djikɛkɛkɛkɛ dji kabeebo na kombe lɛpɛtɛ idji inɔi bokɛkɛ ta tei e palanga, baisalelaka pongono ta ehole emina.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Iboa Yesu abea batingami ba nde ko abala na bu bo: «Naotɔndeakadeani, sooti mɛnɛ bo: mwali o bogwa iyoyo adii mokwali, apaki ibondja bonɔ bato basusu ibibi baisaki mabondja ta etanda. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Modjɔ mo, bakina bapa palanga djinɛnɛ ko bakina djikina ko mwali iyoyo apa palanga djisusu djidaaka na nde ko djibwanaka na nde bohelama.»<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s">Yesu atɔndei bo tepelo ebukamadea</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat 24, 1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luk 21, 5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Ehole eimanaka Yesu ta tepelo, omɔti o batingami ba nde abala na nde bo: «Molehi, indja mabanga imimi mapele! Ko ndako epele mondumba imumu!» <verse eid="MRK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Oɛnɛkɛdea ndako inɛnɛ itonga bo? Ibanga imɔti itadikabi ibaki ta diko di ibanga ikina; masusu mabukamabi.»<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndjokwa ko na minɔngɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat 24, 3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luk 21, 7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Yesu adaa ta ngomba e mele mi Olive eyɛlɛmɛni na tepelo. Petelo, Djake, Yoane na Andele badaaka polo emɔti na nde bamowadja bo: <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />«Lotɔndea ndelo ndani ebwani bokɔmɔ midjɔ mimina misusu ko embete ndani einedjabi bo ndelo emina eimei.» <verse eid="MRK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Iboa Yesu abanga bobatɔndea bo: «Kebani moto omɔti adae pɛpɛ bopɛngodjani. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Bato banɛnɛ badoabi na kombe e mbi. Babalabi bo: “Mbi nadii Masiya!” Ko bakoseabi bato banɛnɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Ndelo eokabi ino gala e bila ko nungunungu dji bila, pɛpɛ bobangani; modjɔ mo midjɔ mimina mibwani bodoa, endelo iyena ediiti mɛnɛ suka e ngondo. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Modjɔ mo bato ba ekomi emɔti baanabi bila na bato ba ekomi ekina, bato ba bokumu bomɔti baanabi bila na bokumu bokina; kpɔtɔ djikumanabi pamba djisusu, ndja epipo ekwabi. Edaabi ondingo mondumba mokabange epeko e mwana. <verse eid="MRK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />Sabaneani ino bɛnɛ modjɔ mo baokababini ta mɔmɔ ma leta bɛngi baosambedjeni ko baobomabini ta ndako dji miɔngɔnɔ mi Bayudha; baosambedjabini ta miso ma ba gupɛlɛnɛlɛ na bakondji tina e mbi, edaabi tati tina e bobo. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Boso mɛnɛ etungi na Bwɛndi Bopele bolehama ta dii bikomi bisusu. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Ehole eoimedjabini ibo ta sambi, pɛpɛ bosatungeabini oko na eka ebwani nanu bobala; tina ebo midjɔ mibalabi ino ta ngonga iyena modjɔ mo mitadongabi ta dii ino, endelo midongabi ta dii Mwembo Mosɛnɔke. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Mwange moto akababi mwanango ta yogo, ko sange o moto akababi mwana o nde; bana baleloabi na baboti ba bobo ko babakababi ta yogo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Mik 7.6.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Olonamabini na bato basusu tina e kombe e mbi. Endelo iyona o gbindeabi molema tee mbunoko a suka ahelabi.»<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛko minɔi na djɛti</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Mat 24, 15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk 21, 20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />«Ehole enɛbi ino moto okabeame “Mobedji onɔi na djɛti” okadikame ta esika etungi na nde pɛpɛ bodaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Dan 9.27; 11.31; 12.11.</char></note>, iyona odaabi alanga asipoe! Iboa, ibia badaabi ta Yudhea batiabi ta ngomba; <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />iyona odaabi ta mbalasani etonga bo diko di ndako atatitabi ta ndako nde bɛngi atombe nongo eka emɔti ta o tei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Mat 24.17 ko nase.</char></note>; <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />ko iyoyo odaabi ta gbie asɔmbetebi ta ngɔngɔ bɛngi atombe mokoto mo nde. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Ndjokwa edaabi ta masu mamina, ta dii bali ba meemi ko na ibia badaakabi bonungea bana! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Angɔnɔni Ndjakomba bɛngi bo midjɔ mimina midae pɛpɛ bodoa ta ehole e piɔ epipo. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Modjɔ mo, ta masu mamina imia, edaabi masu ma ndjokwa ko ebwaniti nongo na ndjokwa emɔti donga mbangi e ngondo, modjɔ mo banga ayoa Ndjakomba ngondo, mɛko mi mondumba momina<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Dan 12.1.</char></note> mipaka kɔɔmɔ mbunoko busa ibubu. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Pɛpɛ bodaa bo Kumu abanea masu mamina, moto nongo omɔti abwaniti bohela. Endelo akuedja ehole emina tina etingi na ibia bahɔɔ iyo. <verse eid="MRK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />Nongo moto akaotɔndeani edɛdiyeye bo: “Injani, Masiya adii iyaya!” Kaoko: “Adii iyanao!” Pɛpɛ bodhimani. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Modjɔ mo ba masia ba bokuta na batɛli ba bokuta bainamabi; bakɔbi midjɔ mi bokamoa na bingengo, ibia bibwani bokosea bato ibia bahɔɔ Ndjakomba. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Iboa ino, tomakebani! Nasi booniteani.»<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bodoa bo Mwana o moto</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat 24, 29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk 21, 25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />«Ekahia ta masu mamina, ngɔngɔ dji masu imia ma ikamba, modaakabusa mohombanabi modidi, songe atangɛsɛbi na ikina, <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />ndjɔtɔ bakwabi, ko ngulu djisusu dji diko djikumanabi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta tina e molɔngɔ mo 24 ko na 25, boɛngɛ Isa 13.10;34.4; Edjek 32.7, Yl 2.10,3.4.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Iboa baɛnɛbi Mwana o moto akɛkɛadonge ta matute, na ngulu djisusu ko na ekumu e nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dan 7.13.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Alomabi babwɛndi ba nde ko aputoanedjabi ibia bahɔɔ iyo ta makono ma ngondo manɛi ta suka suka e kpɔtɔ ko ta suka suka e busa o diko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Dit 30.4. Djak 2.10. Nem 1.9.</char></note>.<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eleho epama na mole mo pigi</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat 24, 32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk 21, 29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />«Sipoani eleho e mole mo pigi, okaenɛni bo tape dji mina djikaɛmbɛɛ ko kasa iyeene itɔi, odjebeni bo pela ebatami<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pela ebatami: etingodji bo yanga esi.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Oko mondumba momina, ehole enɛbi inoni midjɔ mimina miakɔmɔ, djebani bo Mwana o moto adii mbuti na bodoa. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Sooti mɛnɛ, naotɔndɔkɔdeani bo: Bato ba mbota iyeye batasiabi ibo basusu boso bo mɛko mimina bokokedjama. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Diko na kpɔtɔ idimoabi, endelo mibalo mi mbi minɔetebi.»<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndjakomba iyo mɛnɛ akadjebe ehole e suka</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Mat 24, 36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />«A modjɔ moindji busa bomina kaoko ngonga emina, moto omɔti tadjebe nongo babwɛndi ta busa te badjebe, na nongo Mwana tadjebe, oko Sesa iyo mɛnɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Kebani! Sɛndjɛlɛni, modjɔ mo otadjebakadeani ndelo ndani eimeabi ehole emina. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Edaabi oko ndenge moto omɔti akɛɛ ta mɔɔngo: akina ndako e nde ko apa kpati ta dii basali ba nde babanee ndako e nde, apa moto na moto na mosala mo nde ko apa mitindo ta dii sindjili asɛndjɛle. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Na tina emina sɛndjɛlɛni, modjɔ mo otadjebakadeani isu ihulabi moswa ndako: ahulabi mɔkɔmɔkɔ, ta ndanda e bulu, ta kɔkɔ o boso, kaoko ehuma. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Akahula gbundumo asakaotaneani odiini ta hiyɔ. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Mɛko imimi misabala mbi na nu nabali na ino basusu: Sɛndjɛlɛni!»<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s">Badaledji ba Bayudha bakɔi inginda ta tina e Yesu.</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26, 1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22, 1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoa 11, 45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Edikaka masu mabae boso bo tɛkɛ e Pasika ko na tɛkɛ e mapa ma pɛpɛ levile<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Boi 12.1-27.</char></note>. Banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ ko na balehi ba mobeko bahombaka mwɛngi mo bopea Yesu na mbombi bɛngi bamowoe. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Ta tina emina basabaleana bo: «Etabɔngɔ ta ndelo e tɛkɛ modjɔ mo bato basa lemoa.»<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwali omɔti asopei Yesu malasi ta molo</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat 26, 6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yoa 12, 1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Yesu adaaka ta Betania, ta dii Simo moto odaaka na mabha; mwali omɔti akwea ta ehole edaaka iyo ta mesa, mwali omina apeaka molangi mo alibatele<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Alibatele: Boindja Mat 26.7 ko nase.</char></note> modaaka na malasi ma motwia mokɔɔmɔ na nale<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nale: edi malasi mamɔti ma so epele, makɔɔmɔ na mole momɔti modi ta pamba e sadiko di ekomi e ɛndi.</char></note> e pɛpɛ iputo. Adipoa molangi momina ko asopea malasi ta molo mo Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Ndambo e bato bakina badaaka ena, basuboa ko basawadjana bo: «Tina esabedja na nde malasi imimi nda?» <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Bataka mwali o mina ko babalaka bo: «Babwanaki botɛkɛ malasi mamina na pata dji palanga <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pata dji panga: Boindja 6.37 ko nase.</char></note>bonɔ mikama misato ko batombe palanga djimina bɛngi bakɔmedje na bakwali!» <verse eid="MRK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Ekahia Yesu abala bo: «Mokinani. Tina e motungeakadeani na nu nda? Modjɔ mosakɔmeani iyo modii mopele. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Ino odikamadeani na bakwali<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Dit 15.11.</char></note> masu masusu, obwani bo bakɔmeani bopele ehole esusu epali ino; endelo mbi, nitadaabi na nu kɔbili. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Akɔɔki midjɔ mibwanaki na nde bokɔɔ. Asuoni malasi tina e bobɔngedja mokuku mo mbi tina ediki mweka bɛngi bapuseini<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta mondumba mo ipusi di bokɔkɔ bo Bayudha baloleaka mokuku mo ebembe ko boisa male na malasi boso bo bopusea. Boindja Mal 16.1.Yoa 19.40. </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Naotɔndekadeani sooti mɛnɛ bo: pamba isusu ilehabi bo Bwɛndi Bopele, ta ngondo mobimba, babalabi midjɔ mikɔini mwali iyo ko badaakabi bamolɛdjɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yudhasi ahombakadea akabe Yesu ta dii ba banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat 26, 14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luk 22, 3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Yudhasi Isikaliote, motingami omɔti ta tei e doomi na babae, akɛɛ ta dii banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ bɛngi abakabee Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Ehole eoka bo modjɔ mo mina, baluma na sepi enɛnɛ ko bamodikana bomopa palanga. Ko Yudhasi abanga bohomba mwɛngi ndani mobwani iyo bokaba Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ayaki mia ma Pasika na batingami ba nde</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat 26, 17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luk 22, 7-14</ref>.<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yoa 13, 21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Ta busa bo mbangi bo tɛkɛ e mapa ma pɛpɛ levile, busa bomina bopaka ibo mbeka e bhata tina e tɛkɛ e Pasika, batingami ba Yesu bawadja bo: «Esika ndani epalakadea wɛ lokɛe aosalingodja mia ma Pasika?» <verse eid="MRK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Iboa Yesu aloma batingami ba nde babae, ko abala na bu bo: «Kɛɛni ta ngando enɛnɛ, osonganadeani na moto omɔti apeli mondungulu mo madiba. Mokimanani, <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />ko polo ekweadea iyo, tɔndeani moswa ndako bo: “Molehi abali bo: omoinedje ekenge e ndako ekini wɛ bɛngi ayake mia ma Pasika engbanga emɔti na batingami ba nde?” <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Ko aonedjadeani ekenge e ndako enɛnɛ e ekpalaka, ebɔngedjama bopele. Ko ta esika e mina olobɔngedjadeani boyaka.» <verse eid="MRK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Batingami bakɛɛ ko bakwea ta ngando enɛnɛ; batanea midjɔ misusu oko mondumba mo batɔndeaka Yesu, ko basɛlingoa mia ma Pasika. <verse eid="MRK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Aimea busa mɔkɔmɔkɔ, Yesu aimea na batingami doomi na babae. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Ehole edaka bo ta mesa ko eyakaka ibo, Yesu abala bo: «Naotɔndeini, edii sooti bo: omɔti ta tei e bino, oyakakadea na mbi, akabadeani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Ndjem 41.10.</char></note>.» <verse eid="MRK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Batingami baoka ndjokwa, ko babanga bomowadja omɔti omɔti: «Edii mbi?» <verse eid="MRK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Edii omɔti ta tei e bino doomi na babae, iyo oyakakadea na mbi mia ta saani emɔti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Edi moto oyakakadea na mbi esika emɔti. Ps 41.10 </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Mwana o moto atungi bogwa oko mondumba mokomama ta Makomi tina e nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Ndjem 22.2-19; Es 53.</char></note>; endelo ndjokwa enɛnɛ na moto iyoyo obwani bokaba Mwana o moto! Eidaaka nongo moto o mina abobotame!»<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mesa e Kumu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat 26, 26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luk 22, 14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Ko 11, 23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Ta ndelo eyakaka ibo, Yesu atomba ipa, ngɔngɔ dji bosakoa Ndjakomba, abuka ko apa na batingami ba nde; abala na bu bo: «Tombani, iyeye edii mokuku mo mbi.» <verse eid="MRK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Atomba naikina keni e vino, asakoa Ndjakomba, abapa, ko ibo basusu bamwaka vino emina. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Yesu abala na bu bo: «Iyeye edii makiya ma mbi, makiya ma baneakadea mokongo mo Ndjakomba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Boi 24.8; Yil 31.31.34. Boindja ta Mat 26.28 ko na nase.</char></note> imimi ma sopea tina e bato banɛnɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Sooti mɛnɛ naotɔndeakadeani bo: nitamwakabi vino iyeye naikina tee oko busa bo mwakabi mbi vino e yeene ta Bokumu bo Ndjakomba.» <verse eid="MRK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Ngɔngɔ dji boemba ndjembo, baso bakɛɛ ta ngomba e mele mi Olive.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atɔndei bo petelo amoinganeadea</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26, 31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22, 31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoa 13, 36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Yesu abala na batingami bo: «Ino basusu otiadeanini, tina ekomami bo: "Naowabi sindjili o bhata, ko bhata bananganabi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Djkl 13.7.</char></note>". <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Ekahia, ngɔngɔ dji bosisoa ta bogwa bo mbi, nasuabi boso ta Galileya.» <verse eid="MRK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Petelo abala na nde bo: «Nongo bakina bakaotia, mbi nabwaniti bootia.» <verse eid="MRK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Iboa, Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Naotɔndei sooti mɛnɛ bo: ta bulu bo busa ibubu, boso bo kɔkɔ abekoe mbala djibae, oinganeadeani mbala djisato.» <verse eid="MRK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Ekahia Petolo abalaka mbala na mbala bo: «Nongo nakaimea mbuti na bogwa nabwaniti boinganea.» Ko ibo basusu babala oko mondumba momina momɔti.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aɔngɔni ta Getesemani</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26, 36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22, 39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Baimea ta polo emɔti iyena ekabee ibo na kombe e Getesemani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Mat 26.36 ko nase.</char></note>, ko Yesu abala na batingami ba nde bo: «Daani iyaya, nakɛi angɔnɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Atomba Petelo, Djake ko na Yoane. Abanga booka bokɛsɛdji ko na bɔɔ, <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />ko abala na bu bo: «Molema mo mbi molumi na bokɛsɛdji mbuti na bogwa; dikani iyaya ko osɛndjɛlɛni.» <verse eid="MRK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Akɛɛ adaa bohali na bu, akwaka ta kpɔtɔ ko angɔnɔkɔ bɛngi, ekabɔngɔ, adae pɛpɛ bodaa na ehole iyeye e saya ta boso bo nde. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Aangɔnɔkɔ bo: «Aba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abba: Edi kombe e alameɛ ekainedje seko sange o moto mɛnɛ e iyona obalakadea kaoko iyona abalakadea bo.</char></note>, Sesa, pɛpɛ nongo modjɔ momɔti mo onɔi; dongedja keni iyeye e saya mbuti na mbi. Ndelo esusu pɛpɛ bokɔ modjɔ imumu mopalakadea mbi, endelo kɔɔ imumu mopalakadea wɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Ahula ko aso abatanea bawɛli hiɔ. Ko abala na Petelo bo: «Simona, owɛi? Ohɔniti bodaa mɔsu nongo ngonga emɔti bɛngi osɛndjɛleni? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Sɛndjɛlɛni ko angɔnɔni, bɛngi osakamekamani. Mwembo modii na ngulu, endelo mokuku modii na bwɛmbu.» <verse eid="MRK 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Asɔmbɔ naikina angɔnɔ ko abala oko midjɔ mimina mimɔti. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Asɔmbɔ naikina ta polo ekina iyo batingami ba nde ko abatanea bawɛli; baihɔnɔkɔ bodaa mɔsu. Ko baidiaka nongo eka emɔti e bomobalea. <verse eid="MRK 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Asɔmbɔ naikina mbala e basato ko abala na bu bo: «Edɛdiyeye obwanini bowɛni ko osahemedjeni mweka? Ehole emina eimei bɛngi Mwana o moto akabame ta mabɔ ma bato ba pekato. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Angɔni! Lokɛeni! indjani, moto iyoyo okabakadeani aimei!»<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bapei Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26, 47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22, 47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yoa 18, 3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Oko ta ehole edaka Yesu abala mɛko mimina, Yudhasi, omɔti o batingami doomi na babae, aimea engbanga emɔti na bato banɛnɛ bapeli bipeko bi bila ko na pengu. Balomamaka na banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ, balehi ba mobeko, ko na basuku. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Yudhasi, iyoyo okabaka Yesu ainedja emumu embete iyeye: «Moto iyoyo opadea mbi ekɔpi, edii iyo. Mopeani, mobaneani bopele.» <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Ehole eimɛa bo na nde mbuti na Yesu, Yudhasi abatama mbuti na nde ko abala na nde bo: «Molehi!» Ko amopa ekɔpi. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Iboa bakina babakea mɔmɔ diko di Yesu ko baso bamopea. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Ekahia omɔti ta tei e ibia badaaka ena atomba mɔmbi mo nde akwɛlɛ mosali o nganga o Ndjakomba o monɛnɛ ko aso amolena itoi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Yoa 18.26.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Yesu abala bo: «Edaki mbi mokondji o batɔmbɔki bɛngi odoeni na mɛmbi ko na pengu apeani?» <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Masu masusu nadaaka na nu ta tepelo ko nalehaka, oidoani apeanini. Endelo edii oto bɛngi Makomi makokedjame. <verse eid="MRK 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Iboa batingami basusu bamokina ko batia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 50 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 14.27.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Mwenga omɔti atingamaka ngɔngɔ dji Yesu, asadingaka na dala, ko bamopea, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />ekahia iyo, asundola dala ko aso atia mbundu.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu boso bo Ikita inɛnɛ di Bayudha</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Mat 26, 57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luk 22, 54-55</ref>.<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yoa 18, 13-14</ref>.<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Bakɛɛ na Yesu ta dii nganga o Ndjakomba o monɛnɛ, iho baputoana na bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ, basuku ko na balehi ba mobeko. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Petelo akimana Yesu tee oko ta ikanga di nganga o Ndjakomba o monɛnɛ. Iho, adaaka na mobondo esika emɔti na sindjili ba nde aokaka mosa. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ na Ikita inɛnɛ di Bayudha bahombaka tati ebwani boloma Yesu ta yogo, baiebolodjaka. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Modjɔ mo bato banɛnɛ, babalaka tati dji bokuta tina e Yesu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 56 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Ndjem 27.12;35.11.</char></note>, endelo ibo basusu batikoanaka milɔkɔ. <verse eid="MRK 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Bato bakina bangɔkɔ ko bakosa na Yesu mɛko bo: <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />«Lokaka abala bo: "Mbi nabukabi tepelo iyeye ekɔɔmɔ na mabɔ ma bato, ko ngɔngɔ dji masu masato nabwani natonge ekina iyeye edaa pɛpɛ botongama na mɔmɔ ma bato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 58 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Yoa 2.19.</char></note>."» <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Endelo ta modjɔ momina, batikoanaka milɔkɔ mi bobo. <verse eid="MRK 14:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Iboa nganga o Ndjakomba o monɛnɛ angɔ ta boso bo Ikita ko awadja Yesu bo: «Wɛ obwaniti nongo bosɔmbedja eka emɔti ta tati idjidji djiopundakadea na bu?» <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Ekahia Yesu apɔpɔnɔkɔ, aisɔmbedjaka nongo eka emɔti. Nganga o Ndjakomba o monɛnɛ amowadjaka na ikina bo: «Wɛ odii Masiya, Mwana o Ndjakomba iyo Odjongoama?» <verse eid="MRK 14:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Edii mbi. Onɛbini Mwana o moto adii ta ebɔ e baami e Ndjakomba Onɔi na Ngulu; ko bodonga ta matute o diko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 62 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndjem 110.1; Dan 7.13.</char></note>.» <verse eid="MRK 14:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Iboa nganga o Ndjakomba o monɛnɛ aala bisendja bi nde ko abala bo: «Lohombakadea naikina ba temo ntina nda! <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Okini mondumba mosasinga iyo Ndjakomba! Olɛdjɛkɛdeani na modjɔ momina bo?» Ko ibo basusu bamodumba na ikambo ko badhimedja bo abwani na bogwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Bakina ta tei e bobo babanga bomotwea masɔi, bamonanga esendja ta miso, bomoboma mabɔtɔ ko babala na nde bo: «Sainedja bo odii motɛli! Loinedja osa oboma nda!» Ngɔngɔ djimina, sindjili batomba Yesu ko babanga bomoboma bipapata.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petelo aingani Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Mat 26, 69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luk 22, 56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yoa 18, 15-18</ref>.<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Ehole edaka Petelo na mobondo ta ikanga, mwali omɔti adoa ena, adaaka mosali mwali omɔti o nganga o Ndjakomba o monɛnɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Aɛnɛ Petelo iyo ookaka mosa, amokokoledja ko abala na nde bo: «Wɛ pongono, oidaaka na Yesu, moto o Nadjalɛtɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 14:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Petolo aingana ko amosɔmbedja bo: «Nitasipoakadea eka epalakadea wɛ bobala.» Ngɔngɔ djimina aimana sokolu, ta monɔkɔ mo ndako. [Iboa kɔkɔ moomi abekoa.] <verse eid="MRK 14:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Endelo mosali mwali amoenɛ na ikina ko abanga botɔndea bato ibia badaaka ena bo: «Moto iyoyo adii omɔti o bobo!» <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Endelo Petelo aingana naikina. Ngɔngɔ djimina, ibia badaaka ena babala na nde bo: «Sooti mɛnɛ odii omɔti o ibia badaaka na nde, modjɔ mo wɛ pongono odii moto o Galileya». <verse eid="MRK 14:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Iboa, Petelo akata seleka bo: «Oko ta kombe e Ndjakomba, nitadjebakadea moto iyona.» <verse eid="MRK 14:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Oko ta ehole emina, kɔkɔ abekoa mbala e babae, iboa, Petelo abanga bolɛdjɛ mɛko mibalaka Yesu na nde bo: «Boso bo kɔkɔ abekoe, oinganeadeani mbala djisato.» Petelo aoka ndjokwa ta molema ko aso abanga boyea biyo.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s">Yesu boso bo Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27, 1-2</ref>.<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk 23, 1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yoa 18, 28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Na ihindihindi, banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ baputoana engbanga emɔti na basuku ko na balehi ba mobeko, edaka Ikita inɛnɛ. Ngɔngɔ dji bonanga Yesu mbɔti, bakɛɛ na nde ko bamokaba ta mabɔ ma Pilato. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Pilato amowadja bo: «Wɛ odii mokondji o Bayudha?» Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Omobali.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Obali: boindja Mat 27.11 ko nase.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ bapundaka Yesu na midjɔ minɛnɛ. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Pilato amowadja na ikina: «Wɛ obwaniti bosɔmbedja nongo eka emɔti ta midjɔ mibalakadea ibo na wɛ?» <verse eid="MRK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Ekahia Yesu aisɔmbedja nongo eka emɔti , ko Pilato aso akamwa bobuke mɛnɛ.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Batitedji Yesu ta yogo</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat 27, 15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23, 13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yoa 18, 39-19, 16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Engi eyenga e tɛke e Pasika, Pilato adaaka na momɛsɛno mo boimedjaka moto omɔti ta bɔlɔkɔ, bobwana na posa e bato. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Enakoboa, ta ehole emina moto omɔti na kombe e Balabasi adaaka ta bɔlɔkɔ engbanga emɔti na bapundji ibia baowaka moto omɔti, ehole ekɔkɔ bo mongangale. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Emumu e bato bakɛɛ ta dii iyo ko bamowadja akɔe oko mondumba momɛsɛnɛkɛ iyo bokɔ. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Pilato abasɔmbedja bo: «Opalakadeani natingoeni mokondji o Bayudha?» <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Modjɔ mo, Pilato adjebaka bo, banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ bamokaba ta dii iyo tina e ikuwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Endelo banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ balindedja emumu e bato bɛngi baimanedje Balabasi. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Pilato asɔmbɔ bobawadja naikina bo: «Epalakadea ino nakɔe na moto iyoyo okabee bo mokondji o Bayudha nde?» <verse eid="MRK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />bagama naikina bo: «Mobaka ta ekulusu!» <verse eid="MRK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Pilato abawadjaka bo: «Bobe bokɔi iyo nda?» Ekahia bagama naikina na ngulu bo: «Mobaka ta ekulusu!» <verse eid="MRK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Pilato bɛngi atitedje milema mi emumu e bato, abaimedja Balabasi, ngɔngɔ djimina abomedja Yesu ndii ko amopa ta mabɔ ma bobo bɛngi bakɛe amobaka ta ekulusu.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Basoda batai Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Mat 27, 27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yoa 19, 2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Basoda bakɛɛ na Yesu ta tei e opango bo gupɛlɛnɛlɛ ko bakɛɛ asabeyana engbanga e bobo esusu. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Balwadja Yesu mokoto mokpetu, bakɔɔ isuku di ndjumbɛ diiyoa ibo ko baibakea ta molo mo nde. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Ngɔngɔ djiimina babanga bomoisea bo: «Mokondji o Bayudha bwandae!» <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Bamobomaka na mobalake mo mososongo ta molo, bamotwɛaka masɔi ta boso ko badaaka na magbunda ko bongulama ta boso bonde. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Ehole esidja ibo bomosɛkɛ bamoiwa mokoto mokpetu ko bamosɔmbedja bisendja bi nde. Ngɔngɔ djimina baimanaka na nde sokolu ko bakɛɛ amobaka ta ekulusu.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu abakami ta ekulusu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27, 32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23, 26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yoa 19, 17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Moto omɔti o Silɛne, kombe e nde Simona, sange e Alekɛdjandɛlɛ na Lupusi, anɔɔkɔ na ndjea emina ta ihule di gbie. Basoda bamolomaka na ngulu bɛngi atombe ekulusu e Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Bakɛɛ na Yesu ta esika ekabee bo Gologota, iyeye etingodjakadea bo esika e «Engɔngɔlɔ e molo». <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Bamopa vino eputoanake na mile, endelo Yesu alona boemwaka. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Ngɔngɔ djimina bamobaka ta ekulusu ko bakabana bisendja bi nde, baboma djeke bɛngi badjebe eka ebwani bodia moto na moto. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Edaka ta ngonga e ibua e ehuma ehole emobaka ibo ta ekulusu. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Bakomaka tina e modjɔ mogwa na nde ta epasa e ibaya bo: «Mokondji o Bayudha». <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Basoda babaka pongono bapundji babae ta bikulusu engbanga emɔti na Yesu, omɔti ta ebɔ e nde e baami ko okina ta ebɔ e nde e bali. [ <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />Iyena edii bokokedjama bobala Makomi bo: «Iyo adaaka ta tei e bapundji.»] <verse eid="MRK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Bato badaaka banɔ na ndjea bomosingaka ko bagbɔkeaka melo; babala na nde bo: «Ee! Wɛ te moto obalaka bo obukadea tepelo, ngɔngɔ dji masu masato ko obwani boetonga, <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />saheledja wɛ mɛnɛ, oko tita ta ekulusu!» <verse eid="MRK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ ko balehi ba mobeko basɛkɛkɛ Yesu oko mondumba momina ko basabaleanaka bo: «Aheledjaka bato bakina, iboa iyo mɛnɛ abwaniti bosaheledja! <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Wɛ okadaa Masiya, mokondji o Isalɛlɛ, tita edɛdiyeye ta ekulusu! Lokaenɛdea na miso, iboa loso lodhime.» Bato babae ibia babakamaka ta ekulusu engbanga emɔti na nde bamosingaka, pongono.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bogwa bo Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27, 45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23, 44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoa 19, 28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Ta ndelo e midhi, modidi mokwa ta kpɔtɔ isusu tee mbunoko ta ngonga e basato e mɔkɔmɔkɔ. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Ta ngonga e basato ngɔngɔ dji midhi, Yesu agama na ngulu bo: «Eloi, Eloi, lamasabakatani?» Etingodji bo: «Ndjakomba o mbi, Ndjakomba o mbi, tina ndani okinini?» <verse eid="MRK 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Bato bakina ibia badaaka ena aoka bo abala iboa baso babalaka bo: «Okani, abeakadea Eliya!» <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Moto omɔti ta tei e bobo apota ebango aisa imbusu ta vino e ngai ta sɔngɔ e mososongo, apa Yesu bɛngi amwake ko abala bo: «Loindje kaoko Eliya o nde adoadea amobakoa ta ekulusu!» <verse eid="MRK 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Ekahia Yesu agama na ngulu ko atsoea molema. <verse eid="MRK 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Esendja enɛnɛ edaaka ta ndanda e Esika Esɛnɔke na Esika enɔi Esɛnɔke ta tepelo ealea bipasa bibae bobanga o diko mbunoko nase. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Mokondji o basodha mokama iyoo oemaka ta boso bo Yesu aɛnɛ mondumba mogwa Yesu ko aso abala bo: «Sooti mɛnɛ, moto iyoo adaaka Mwana o Ndjakomba!» <verse eid="MRK 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Ndambo e bali badaaka baemi ena, ibo pongono, baɛnɛkɛ midjɔ mimina misusu na bohali. Ta tei e bobo, edaka Malia o ngando e Magadala, Malia, nange e Djake, iyoyo obeaka ibo mwana o ngɔngɔ na Djodje, ko na Salome, <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Bali bamina badaaka bamokimana ko bomokɔmedjaka ehole edaaka iyo ta Galileya. Edaaka pongono na bakina bali banɛnɛ ibia baiweaka na nde ta Yelusalɛmɛ.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aisami ta mombɔndɔ mo ikila</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27, 57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23, 50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoa 19, 38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Busa boimeaka mɔkɔmɔkɔ, edaaka busa bo Mosɛlingo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Mat 27.62 ko na nase.</char></note> mo sabata. <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Yosepu moto o Alimatayo, adaaka ta engbanga e Ikita dinɛnɛ ko bamosumaka bobuke mɛnɛ, ambaka na ingbangba inɛnɛ Bokumu bo Ndjakomba. Akɛɛ na bosusu mɛnɛ awadja Pilato ebembe e Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Pilato akamwa ehole aoka iyo bo Yesu agwi. Iboa abea mokondji o basodha mokama ko amowadja bo: «Yesu agwaki ehele?» <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Iyana amosɔmbedja mokondji o basodha bo Yesu agwi, Pilato apa Yosepu ndjea atombe ebembe e Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Yosepu asomba dala e lino, atitedja ebembe e Yesu ta ekulusu, aehua na esendja emina ko aepusea ta mombɔndɔ molongaka iyo ta tei e ibanga dinɛnɛ. Ngɔngɔ djimina adipa monɔkɔ mo mombɔndɔ momina na ibanga dikina dimɔti dinɛnɛ. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Malia o ngando e Magadala na Malia nange Djodje baindjaka esika emopuseaka ibo.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s">Bosisoa bo Yesu ta bogwa</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat 28, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24, 1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yoa 20, 1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Ngnɔgɔ dji busa bo sabata, Malia o ngando e Magadala, Malia nange Djake, ko na Salome basomba malasi ma so epele bɛngi bakɛe asopea ebembe e Yesu ekakane edae pɛpɛ bopɔ. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Nahindihindi ta isu di boso di eyenga, ta eyeli e busa, ibo baso bakɛɛ aindja ikila. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Basawadjaka ta tei e bobo bo: «Moto ndani olohilingoanedjadea ibanga ibakea bo ta monɔkɔ mo mombɔndɔ mo ikila?» <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Ekahia ndelo edumba bo miso, baɛnɛ bo basi bohilingoanedja ibanga ehele, tina ebo ibanga dimina idaaka inɛnɛ mɛnɛ. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Bali baso bakwea ta ikila; baɛnɛ ena mwenga omɔti, adii na mobondo ta ebɔ e baami, alwaka mokoto mopu, ko bali bamina baso babanga. <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Ekahia mwenga abatɔndea bo: «Pɛpɛ bobangani oko; ohombakadeani Yesu o Nadjalɛtɛ, iyo obakakabi bo ta ekulusu; asisoi ta bogwa, aditi iyaya. Indjani polo e mosambeakibo ibo iyo iyeye. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Kɛɛni edɛdiyeye adjebedja batingami ba nde, na Petelo pongono bo: “Akɛi aombani ta Galileya; omoɛnɛdeani iho, oko mondumba motɔndeakani iyo mɛnɛ.” » <verse eid="MRK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Bali baimana ta ikila, ko bayana apote mbango bakɛkɛ angongome na bɔɔ. Ko baitɔndea nongo moto omɔti, modjɔ mo badaaka na bɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 16:8">Yesu asainedji na malia o ngando e magadala</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 16:8">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mat 28, 9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Yoa 20, 11-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 16:8">[ <verse eid="MRK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Ta ehuma e busa bo eyenga ngɔngɔ dji Yesu bosisoa ta bogwa, Asaenɛmedja boso mɛnɛ na Malia o ngando e Magadala, iyona oheledjaka iyo na bomobenganea membo mibe sambo. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Akɛɛ atondea Bwɛndi ta dii batingami ibia badaaka na nde. Iboa ibo badaaka na ndjokwa ko bayeaka. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Baoka Malia abalaka bo: «Yesu adii na bomɔ, aimaneini!», baimodhimea.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asaɛnɛmedji na batingami babae</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Luk 24, 13-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Ngɔngɔ djimina, Yesu asaɛnɛmedja na mondumba mokina na batingami babae ibia badaaka na ndjea bɛngi bakɛe ta diako. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Ibo pongono basɔmbɔ ko badjebedja bina bu, baibadhimea pɛpɛ nongo mweka.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asainedji na batingami doomi na omɔti</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28, 16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24, 36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yoa 20, 19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Bik 1, 6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Ta mbala e suka, Yesu asainedja na batingami doomi na omɔti ehole eyakaka bo ta mesa; abadosa na taka e bobo e edhimeli ko na milema mipipo mi pɛpɛ bodhima midjɔ mibatɔndeaka bato ibibi badaaka bamoɛnɛ ta bosisoa bo nde ta bogwa. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Ngɔngɔ djimina abala na bu bo: «Kɛɛni ta ngondo esusu, lehani Bwɛndi Bopele ta dii bato basusu. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Moto odhimadea atombe batisimo, moto omina iyona ahelabi; ko moto iyona odaabi pɛpɛ bodhima akwabi na ikambo. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Indjani bimbete bikɔmɔbi ta dii bato ibia badhimeabini: Na kombe e mbi babenganabi membo mibe; babalabi kɔpi dji yeene; <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />nongo bakapea ndjɔ na mabɔ kaoko bakamwa moselo, eka emɔti ebe ebwaniti bobakɔɔ; babakeabi mɔmɔ diko di bato ba bego, ko babolodjabi mohelo.»<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asɔmbi mbuti na Ndjakomba</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luk 24, 50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Bik 1, 9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Ngɔngɔ dji Kumu Yesu bobala na bu, angɔdjɔmɔ ta busa ko akɛɛ adaa ta ebɔ e baami e Ndjakomba. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Batingami bakɛɛ aleha Bwɛndi Bopele ta bisika bisusu. Kumu adaaka asala na bu ko abapa bokumu bo bokɔɔ midjɔ mi bokamoa minɛnɛ tina e bopa ngulu ta mobalo mo nde.]<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>